Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry。Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marge。How lovely to see…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle Vernon，I need you to sign this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。School stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Later perhaps，if you behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will if she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，you're still here，are you？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't say yes in that ungrateful way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn good of my brother to keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'd have been straight to an orphanage if he'd been dumped on my doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that my Dudders？Is that my little neffy-pooh？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us a kiss。Come on。Up，up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take Marge's suitcase upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finish that off for Mommy。Good boy，Rippy-pooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can I tempt you，Marge？- Just a small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent nosh，Petunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,A bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Usually just a fry-up for me，what with 12 dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just a bit more。That's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna try a little drop of brandy？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little drop of brandy-brandy windy-wandy for Rippy-pippy-pooh？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you smirking at？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did you send the boy，Vernon？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,St。Brutus'。It's a fine institution for hopeless cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do they use a cane at St。Brutus'，boy？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I've been beaten loads of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent。I won't have this namby-pamby…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,…wishy-washy nonsense about not beating people who deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mustn't blame yourself about how this one turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all to do with blood。Bad blood will out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it the boy's father did，Petunia？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。He didn't work。He was unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And a drunk too，no doubt？- That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What did you say？- My dad wasn't a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。Don't fuss，Petunia。I have a very firm grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's time you went to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet，Vernon。You，clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，it's nothing to do with the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all to do with the mother。You see it all the time with dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,If something's wrong with the bitch，then something's wrong with the pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vernon！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vernon！Vernon，do something！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got you，Marge。I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hold on，hold on。- Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't you dare！- Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Vernon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marge！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marge！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come back！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You bring her back！You bring her back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You put her right！- No。She deserved what she got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keep away from me。- You can't do magic outside school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？Try me。- They won't let you back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care。Anywhere is better than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Welcome to the Knight Bus…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…emergency transport for the stranded witch or wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Stan Shunpike，and I will be your conductor for this evening.「
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you doing down there？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I fell over。- What you fell over for？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I didn't do it on purpose。- Well，come on，then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's not wait for the grass to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What you looking at？- Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，come on，then。In.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。I'll get this。You get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Move on，move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Take her away，Ern。- Yeah，take it away，Ernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's going to be a bumpy ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What did you say your name was？- I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whereabouts are you headed？- The Leaky Cauldron。That's in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear that？「The Leaky Cauldron。That's in London.」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Leaky Cauldron。If you have pea soup…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…make sure you eat it before it eats you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But the Muggles。Can't they see us？- Muggles？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,They don't see nothing，do they？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but if you jab them with a fork，they feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ernie，little old lady at 12 o'clock！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten，nine，eight…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…seven，six，five…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…four，three，three and a half…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…two，one and three quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is Sirius Black，that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've never been hearing of Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got himself locked up in Azkaban for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How did he escape？- Well，that's the question，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the first one that done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.73,0:11:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was a big supporter of…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I reckon you've heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Him I've heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ernie，two double-deckers at 12 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're getting closer，Ernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ernie，they're right on top of us！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，guys？Guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why the long faces？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah。Nearly there。Nearly there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The Leaky Cauldron。- Next stop，Knockturn Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Potter，at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Take it away，Ern。- Yeah，take it away，Ernie！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Room 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right smart bird you got there，Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,He arrived here just five minutes before yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,As Minister for Magic，it is my duty to inform you，Mr。Potter…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…earlier this evening your uncle's sister was located…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a little south of Sheffield，circling a chimney stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Accidental Magic Reversal Department was dispatched immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,She has been properly punctured and her memory modified.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,She will have no recollection of the incident whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,So that's that…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and no harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pea soup？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Minister？- Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't understand。- Understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I broke the law。Underage wizards can't use magic at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come now。The Ministry doesn't send people to Azkaban…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…for blowing up their aunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the other hand，running away like that，given the state of things…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…was very，very irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「The state of things，」 sir？- We have a killer on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius Black，you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what's he got to do with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing，of course。You're safe。And that's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,And tomorrow you'll be on your way back to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are your new schoolbooks。I took the liberty…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of having them brought here。Now Tom will show you to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，by the way，Harry。Whilst you're here，it would be best if you didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…wander.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right！You gonna move that bus or what？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Housekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm warning you，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep that beast away from Scabbers，or I'll turn it into a tea cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a cat，Ronald。What do you expect？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's in his nature。- A cat？Is that what they told you？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Looks like a pig with hair。- That's rich…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…coming from the owner of that smelly old shoe brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crookshanks，just ignore the mean little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Egypt。What's it like？- Brilliant。Loads of old stuff…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:17:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…like mummies，tombs，even Scabbers enjoyed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Egyptians used to worship cats。- Along with the dung beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not flashing that clipping again？- I haven't shown anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not a soul。Not unless you count Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The day maid。- Night maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cook。- The bloke who fixed the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry。- Mrs。Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good to see you，dear。- Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Got everything？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes？All your books？- It's all upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your clothes？- Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good boy。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry Potter。- Mr。Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry，wonder if I might have a word？- Yeah，sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hermione。- Good morning，Mr。Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Looking forward to a new term？- Yeah。It should be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，some within the Ministry would strongly discourage me…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…from divulging what I'm about to reveal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I think that you need to know the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has this anything to do with Sirius Black，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you know about Sirius Black，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Only that he's escaped from Azkaban。- Do you know why？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thirteen years ago，when you stopped…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Voldemort。- Don't say his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you stopped You-Know-Who…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Black lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,But to this day，he still remains a faithful servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in his mind…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.31,0:18:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you are the only thing that stands in the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of You-Know-Who returning to power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that is why…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he has escaped from Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,To find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，swear to me that whatever you might hear…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you won't go looking for Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Weasley…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…why would I go looking for someone who wants to kill me？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick。Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，Ron！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，for goodness' sake！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't lose him！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to blow her up。I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I lost control。- Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，Ron，it's not funny。Harry was lucky not to be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was lucky not to be arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still think it was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Everywhere else is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you think that is？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.61,0:19:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,225 - Professor R.J。Lupin。- Do you know everything？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,How is it she knows everything？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's on his suitcase，Ronald。- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.35,0:19:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you think he's really asleep？- Seems to be。Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight。Sirius Black escaped from Azkaban…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …to come after you？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they'll catch Black，won't they？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I mean，everyone's looking for him。- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except no one's ever broken out of Azkaban before…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …and he's a murderous，raving lunatic。- Thanks，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are we stopping？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't be there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Maybe we've broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ouch，Ron。That was my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something moving out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think someone's coming aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell！What's happening？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，eat this。It'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right。It's chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.65,0:22:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was that thing that came？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.89,0:23:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a dementor。One of the guards of Azkaban。It's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was searching the train for Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me，I need to have a little word with the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eat。You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to me？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you sort of went rigid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.71,0:23:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,We thought maybe you were having a fit or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.65,0:23:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,And did either of you two…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …pass out？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.36,0:23:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I felt weird，though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like I'd never be cheerful again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,But someone was screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one was screaming，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome！Welcome to another year at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,267 Now，I'd like to say a few words…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…before we all become too befuddled by our excellent feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，I'm pleased to welcome Professor R.J。Lupin…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.51,0:25:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…who's kindly consented to fill the post…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck，professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.89,0:25:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。That's why he knew to give you the chocolate，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.39,0:25:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter。Is it true you fainted？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I mean，you actually fainted？- Shove off，Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.10,0:25:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How did he find out？- Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our Care of Magical Creatures teacher…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…has decided to retire…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in order to spend more time with his remaining limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fortunately，I'm delighted to announce…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that his place will be taken by none other…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…than our own Rubeus Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:26:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally，on a more disquieting note…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…at the request of the Ministry of Magic…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Hogwarts will，until further notice，play host to the dementors of Azkaban…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.88,0:26:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…until such a time as Sirius Black is captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dementors will be stationed at every entrance to the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now whilst I've been assured…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that their presence will not disrupt our day-to-day activities…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.79,0:26:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a word of caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.32,0:26:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dementors are vicious creatures。They'll not distinguish…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.66,0:26:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…between the one they hunt and the one who gets in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.23,0:26:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Therefore，I must warn each and every one of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.07,0:26:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to give them no reason to harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.47,0:26:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is not in the nature of a dementor to be forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you know，happiness can be found…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…even in the darkest of times…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.99,0:26:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if one only remembers to turn on the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.90,0:27:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fortuna Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，listen。She just won't let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.58,0:27:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fortuna Major。- No，no。Wait，wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.26,0:27:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Amazing。Just with my voice。- Fortuna Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，all right。Go in。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.04,0:27:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still doing that after three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.17,0:27:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She can't even sing。- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，man。- Hey，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.75,0:27:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，God。- That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Green。That's a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is that？- You call that a monkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.89,0:28:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not give him one again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.26,0:28:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Neville，try an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron，catch。- I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.98,0:28:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，don't try one of them。- Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at him。His face.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.09,0:29:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome，my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.53,0:29:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,In this room，you shall explore the noble art of Divination.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.84,0:29:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,In this room，you shall discover if you possess the Sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.54,0:29:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。I am Professor Trelawney.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Together we shall cast ourselves into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,This term，we'll focus on Tasseomancy，the art of reading tea leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.49,0:29:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,So please，take the cup of the person sitting opposite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.56,0:29:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you see？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.13,0:29:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,The truth lies buried like a sentence deep within a book，waiting to be read.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But first，you must broaden your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:30:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- First，you must look beyond。- What a load of rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.31,0:30:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where did you come from？- Me？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've been here all this time。- You，boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is your grandmother quite well？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.18,0:30:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure of that。Give me the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Broaden your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your aura is pulsing，dear。Are you in the beyond？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think you are。- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at the cup。Tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.44,0:30:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.97,0:30:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry's got sort of a wonky cross。That's trials and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.81,0:30:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that there could be the sun and that's happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.18,0:30:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you're gonna suffer，but you're gonna be happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.42,0:30:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.33,0:30:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.30,0:30:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dear…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you have the Grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.60,0:31:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Grin？What's the Grin？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.51,0:31:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the Grin，you idiot。The Grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.54,0:31:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Taking form of a giant spectral dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's among the darkest omens in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.91,0:31:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an omen…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.75,0:31:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of death.「
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.22,0:31:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't think that Grim thing's got anything to do with Sirius Black？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.13,0:31:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，honestly，Ron。If you ask me，Divination's a woolly discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.23,0:31:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Ancient Runes，that's a fascinating subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ancient Runes？Exactly how many classes are you taking？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.37,0:31:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,A fair few.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.21,0:31:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on。That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.47,0:31:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ancient Runes is in the same time as Divination.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.38,0:31:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to be in two classes at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.55,0:31:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be silly。How could anyone be in two classes at once？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.12,0:31:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Broaden your minds。Use your Inner Eye to see the future.」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。Come on，now。Come closer。Less talking，if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.66,0:32:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a real treat for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.66,0:32:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,A great lesson。So follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.94,0:32:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，you lot。Less chattering。Form a group over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.18,0:32:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,And open your books to page 49.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly how do we do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.68,0:32:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stroke the spine，of course。Goodness me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.93,0:32:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't be such a wimp，Longbottom。- I'm okay。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.44,0:32:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think they're funny。- Oh，yeah。Terribly funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.87,0:32:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Witty。God，this place has gone to the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.54,0:32:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait until Father hears Dumbledore's got this oaf teaching classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up，Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dementor！Dementor！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just ignore him。- You're supposed to stroke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.95,0:33:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't he beautiful？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.12,0:33:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say hello to Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.36,0:33:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid，exactly what is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,That，Ron，is a hippogriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.00,0:33:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,First thing you wanna know is they're very proud creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very easily offended。You do not want to insult a hippogriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.81,0:33:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It may be the last thing you ever do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:34:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，who'd like to come and say hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.62,0:34:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Harry。Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you have to let him make the first move。It's only polite。So…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.83,0:34:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…step up。Give him a nice bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.93,0:34:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you wait and see if he bows back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he does，you can go and touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,If not… Well，we'll get to that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.71,0:34:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just make your bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.31,0:34:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice and low.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back off，Harry。Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.85,0:34:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.02,0:34:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Harry。Well done。Here，you big brute，you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.18,0:35:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。I think you can go and pat him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on。Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.15,0:35:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice and slow，now。Nice and slow。Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.96,0:35:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not so fast，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.50,0:35:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slow down，Harry。That's it…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.94,0:35:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice and slow。Now let him come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slowly，now，slowly，slowly…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.51,0:35:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.91,0:35:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.85,0:35:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done！Well done，Harry，well done！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.42,0:35:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does he get to fly？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.62,0:35:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think he may let you ride him now。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.22,0:35:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。- Hey，hey，hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.93,0:35:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put you over here，just behind the wing joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:36:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't pull out any of his feathers，because he won't thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Harry，and well done，Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was wicked，Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.94,0:37:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.11,0:37:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.11,0:37:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How am I doing me first day？- Brilliant，professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.72,0:38:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not dangerous at all，are you，you great ugly brute！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.16,0:38:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malfoy，no…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.43,0:38:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.63,0:38:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buckbeak！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.43,0:38:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，whoa…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.77,0:38:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！Buckbeak！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.70,0:38:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Away，you silly creature…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.24,0:38:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's killed me！- Calm down。It's just a scratch！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.54,0:38:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.88,0:38:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He has to be taken to the hospital。- I'm the teacher。I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.15,0:38:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're gonna regret this。- Class dismissed！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.19,0:38:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and your bloody chicken！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.95,0:39:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does it hurt terribly，Draco？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,It comes and it goes。Still，I consider myself lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.22,0:39:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madam Pomfrey said another minute and I could've lost my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.89,0:39:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't do homework for weeks。- Listen to the idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's really laying it on thick，isn't he？- At least Hagrid didn't get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear Draco's father's furious。We haven't heard the end of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.44,0:39:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's been sighted！- Who？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.47,0:39:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius Black！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.24,0:39:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dufftown？That's not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.61,0:39:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't think he'd come to Hogwarts，do you？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.41,0:39:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- With dementors at every entrance？- Dementors？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.08,0:39:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,He slipped past them once。Who's to say he won't do it again？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.62,0:39:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。Black could be anywhere。It's like trying to catch smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like trying to catch smoke with your bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.25,0:40:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Intriguing，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.56,0:40:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would anyone like to venture a guess…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…as to what is inside？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.50,0:40:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's a boggart，that is。- Very good，Mr。Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，can anybody tell me what a boggart looks like？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.41,0:40:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No one knows。- When did she get here？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.67,0:40:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boggarts are shape-shifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.38,0:40:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,They take the shape of whatever a person fears the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.78,0:40:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's what makes them so… - So terrifying，yes，yes，yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.38,0:40:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luckily，a very simple charm exists to repel a boggart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.22,0:40:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's practice it now。Without wands，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.29,0:40:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,After me。Riddikulus！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:41:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Riddikulus！- Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little louder and very clear。Listen：
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.07,0:41:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Riddikulus！- Riddikulus！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.47,0:41:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This class is ridiculous。- Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.77,0:41:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,So much for the easy part。You see，the incantation alone is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.94,0:41:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What really finishes a boggart is laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.88,0:41:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to force it to assume a shape you find truly amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.45,0:41:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me explain。Neville，would you join me，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.82,0:41:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，don't be shy。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.13,0:41:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.30,0:41:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。Neville，what frightens you most of all？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.00,0:41:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sorry？- Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.90,0:41:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Snape。Yes，frightens all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.47,0:41:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You live with your grandmother。- I don't want it to turn into her，either.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.45,0:41:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.88,0:41:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it won't。I want you to picture her clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.92,0:41:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only her clothes，very clearly，in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.35,0:41:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She carries a red handbag… - We don't need to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.59,0:42:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as you see it，we'll see it。Now，when I open that wardrobe…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.70,0:42:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…here's what I want you to do。Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.47,0:42:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Imagine Professor Snape in your grandmother's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.60,0:42:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.90,0:42:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Wand at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，two，three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.19,0:42:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think，Neville，think.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.83,0:42:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Riddikulus！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.47,0:42:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wonderful，Neville，wonderful！Incredible！Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.30,0:42:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to the back，Neville。Everyone，form a line…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.44,0:42:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Form a line！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.95,0:42:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want everyone to picture the thing they fear the very most…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.55,0:42:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and turn it into something funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.85,0:43:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Next！Ron！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.79,0:43:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Concentrate。Face your fear。Be brave！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.84,0:43:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wand at the ready，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.11,0:43:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Riddikulus！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.08,0:43:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！You see？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.05,0:43:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very good，very good！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.45,0:43:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marvelous！Absolutely，very，very enjoyable！Parvati！Next！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show us what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.57,0:43:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep your nerve。Steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.14,0:43:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Riddikulus！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,And next！Step up，step up！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.18,0:44:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wonderful，wonderful！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.03,0:44:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.00,0:44:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Riddikulus！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.31,0:44:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Sorry about that。That's enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.41,0:44:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Collect your books from the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.58,0:44:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the end of the lesson。Thank you！Sorry！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.39,0:44:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，you can have too much of a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.42,0:44:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember，these visits to Hogsmeade village are a privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.30,0:44:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should your behavior reflect poorly on the school…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.30,0:44:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that privilege shall not be extended again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.70,0:45:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No permission form signed，no visiting the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.17,0:45:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the rule，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.94,0:45:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those with permission，follow me。Those without，stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.28,0:45:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought if you signed it，then I could…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.95,0:45:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't。Only a parent or a guardian can sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.62,0:45:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since I am neither，it would be inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Potter。That's my final word.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.93,0:45:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget about it，guys。See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.98,0:45:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor，can I ask you something？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.21,0:45:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to know why I stopped you facing that boggart，yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.28,0:45:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.85,0:45:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I assumed it would take the shape of Lord Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.86,0:45:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did think of Voldemort at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.59,0:45:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,But then I remembered that night on the train…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.40,0:45:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …and the dementor。- I'm very impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.10,0:46:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That suggests what you fear the most is fear itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.17,0:46:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is very wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.84,0:46:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before I fainted…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.17,0:46:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.71,0:46:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,A woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.74,0:46:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,…screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.31,0:46:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dementors force us to relive our very worst memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.75,0:46:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our pain becomes their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.52,0:46:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it was my mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.89,0:46:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the night she was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.72,0:46:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The very first time I saw you，Harry，I recognized you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.80,0:46:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not by your scar，by your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.07,0:46:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're your mother，Lily's.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.17,0:46:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.94,0:46:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes。I knew her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.24,0:46:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mother was there for me at a time when no one else was.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.28,0:46:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not only was she a singularly gifted witch…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.68,0:46:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…she was also an uncommonly kind woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.52,0:46:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,She had a way of seeing the beauty in others…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.76,0:47:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…even，and most especially，when that person could not see it in themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.40,0:47:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,And your father，James，on the other hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.30,0:47:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.34,0:47:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He had a certain，shall we say，talent for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.94,0:47:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,A talent，rumor has it，he passed on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.45,0:47:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're more like them than you know，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.26,0:47:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,In time，you'll come to see just how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.83,0:47:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honeyduke's Sweetshop is brilliant，but nothing beats Zonko's Joke Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.47,0:47:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,We never got to go to the Shrieking Shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You heard it's the most… - Haunted building in Britain。I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.61,0:47:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably Neville forgot the password again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.85,0:47:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Oh，you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.45,0:48:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me through，please。Excuse me！I'm Head Boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.35,0:48:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back，all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.22,0:48:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one is to enter this dormitory until it's been searched.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.53,0:48:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fat Lady！She's gone！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.00,0:48:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Serves her right。She was a terrible singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.60,0:48:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's not funny，Ron。- Keep calm，everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.54,0:48:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Break into fours.Back to your common room。- Be quiet.The headmaster's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.95,0:48:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.11,0:48:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.35,0:48:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You heard。Move！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.50,0:48:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Filch？Round up the ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them to search every painting in the castle to find the Fat Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.01,0:48:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no need for ghosts，professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.88,0:49:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fat Lady's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.85,0:49:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mind where you're going！Slow down！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.90,0:49:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You listen！I'm Head Boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.29,0:49:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come back here！- Keep moving！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.29,0:49:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dear lady，who did this to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.10,0:49:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eyes like the devil，he's got，and a soul as dark as his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.07,0:49:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's him，headmaster。The one they all talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.24,0:49:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's here，somewhere in the castle！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.91,0:49:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius Black！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.31,0:49:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Secure the castle，Mr。Filch。The rest of you，to the Great Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.48,0:50:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've searched the Astronomy Tower and the Owlery。There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.58,0:50:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- The third floor's clear too，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.18,0:50:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Very good。- I've done the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.45,0:50:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No sign of Black，nor anywhere else in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.36,0:50:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't really expect him to linger.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.09,0:50:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remarkable feat，don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,To enter Hogwarts Castle on one's own…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.10,0:50:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …completely undetected？- Quite remarkable，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.97,0:50:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any theories on how he managed it？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.00,0:50:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Many。Each as unlikely as the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.21,0:50:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may recall…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.91,0:50:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…prior to the start of term I expressed concerns…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.91,0:50:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…about your appointment of Professor…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a single professor inside this castle would help Sirius Black enter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.42,0:50:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm quite convinced the castle is safe…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.99,0:50:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I'm more than willing to send the students to their houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.79,0:50:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about Potter？Should he be warned？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.33,0:50:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps。But for now，let him sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.83,0:51:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,For in dreams，we enter a world that's entirely our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.87,0:51:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let them swim in the deepest ocean or glide over the highest cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.68,0:51:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn to page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.46,0:52:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，sir。Where's Professor Lupin？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.73,0:52:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not really your concern，is it，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.37,0:52:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Suffice it to say your professor finds himself incapable of teaching…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.44,0:52:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…at the present time。Turn to page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.28,0:52:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Werewolves」？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.28,0:52:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，we just learned about red caps and hinkypunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.29,0:52:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're not meant to start that for weeks。- Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.62,0:52:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did she come in？Did you see her come in？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.43,0:52:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，which one of you can tell me the difference…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.13,0:52:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…between an Animagus and a werewolf？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.30,0:52:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.74,0:52:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How disappointing。- Please，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.84,0:52:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,An Animagus is a wizard who elects to turn into an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.14,0:52:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,A werewolf has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.11,0:52:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,With each full moon…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.01,0:52:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he no longer remembers who he is。He'd kill his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.08,0:53:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,The werewolf only responds to the call of its own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.82,0:53:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。Malfoy。That's the second time…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.76,0:53:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you've spoken out of turn，Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.26,0:53:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you incapable of restraining yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.43,0:53:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…or do you take pride in being an insufferable know-it-all？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.10,0:53:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's got a point，you know。- Five points from Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.70,0:53:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,As an antidote to your ignorance，and on my desk，by Monday morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.51,0:53:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…two rolls of parchment on the werewolf，with emphasis…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.34,0:53:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …on recognizing it。- It's Quidditch tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.05,0:53:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I suggest you take extra care，Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.59,0:53:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Loss of limb will not excuse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.82,0:53:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.60,0:53:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The term 「werewolf」…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.00,0:53:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is a contraction of the Anglo-Saxon word 「wer」…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.50,0:53:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…which means 「man，」 and 「wolf.」
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.70,0:53:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Werewolf，man-wolf.There are several ways to become a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.84,0:54:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,They include being given the power of shape-shifting…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.90,0:54:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,…being bitten by a werewolf…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.87,0:54:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go，Harry！- Go，Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.26,0:56:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aresto momentum！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.33,0:56:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He looks a bit peaky，doesn't he？- Peaky？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.67,0:56:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you expect？He fell over 100 feet。- Come on，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's walk you off a tower and see what you look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.21,0:56:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably a right sight better than he normally does.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.88,0:56:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How are you feeling？- Oh，brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.05,0:56:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gave us a right good scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.28,0:56:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happened？- Well，you fell off your broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.05,0:56:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？I meant the match。Who won？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.83,0:57:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one blames you，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.80,0:57:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dementors aren't supposed to be on the grounds。Dumbledore's furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.80,0:57:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,After he saved you，he sent them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.07,0:57:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something else you should know too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.31,0:57:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you fell，your broom sort of blew into the Whomping Willow，and…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.60,0:57:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.85,0:57:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to hear about your broomstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.45,0:57:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there no chance of fixing it？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.29,0:57:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.82,0:57:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor，why do the dementors affect me so？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.56,0:57:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I mean，more than everyone else？- Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.83,0:57:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dementors are the foulest creatures to walk this earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.20,0:57:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,They feed on every good feeling，every happy memory…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.04,0:57:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…until a person is left with absolutely nothing but his worst experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.81,0:57:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are not weak，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.18,0:58:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dementors affect you most because there are true horrors in your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.45,0:58:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Horrors your classmates can scarcely imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.02,0:58:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.52,0:58:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm scared，professor。- I'd consider you a fool if you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.73,0:58:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to know how to fight them。You could teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.40,0:58:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You made the one on the train go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.60,0:58:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was only one that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.67,0:58:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But you made it go away。- I don't pretend to be an expert，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.58,0:58:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,But as the dementors seem to have developed an interest in you…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.71,0:58:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…perhaps I should teach you。But after the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,For now，I need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.01,0:59:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last call for Hogsmeade！Come on，now！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.80,0:59:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Guys，let me go。- Clever，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.80,0:59:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But not clever enough。- We've got a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.07,0:59:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm trying to get to Hogsmeade。- We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.07,0:59:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't worry - We'll get you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.61,0:59:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll show you a quicker way。- lf you pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.31,0:59:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bless him。- Let me go！Come on，guys。Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.51,0:59:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Harry。Come and join the big boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.52,0:59:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.92,0:59:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's this rubbish？- 「What's this rubbish？」 he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's the secret to our success。- It's a wrench giving it to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.43,0:59:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we've decided your needs are greater than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.50,0:59:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,George，if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.47,0:59:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I solemnly swear that I am up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.37,1:00:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Messrs。Moony，Wormtail，Padfoot and Prongs…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.34,1:00:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…are proud to present the Marauder's Map.「
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.55,1:00:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,We owe them so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.35,1:00:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on。This is Hogwarts。And that…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.36,1:00:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。Is that really… - Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.26,1:00:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- In his study。- Pacing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.43,1:00:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.70,1:00:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So this map shows… - Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.70,1:00:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where they are。- What they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.90,1:00:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Every minute。- Every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Brilliant！Where did you get it？- From Filch's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.37,1:00:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- First year。- There are seven secret passageways…out of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.34,1:00:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd recommend this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.08,1:00:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The One-Eyed Witch passageway。- Leads you to Honeyduke's.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.41,1:00:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry。Filch is heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.42,1:00:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't forget。When you're done，just give it a tap and say：
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.02,1:00:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Mischief managed.」 Otherwise，anyone can read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.15,1:01:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.11,1:01:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's meant to be the most haunted building in Britain。Did I mention that？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.35,1:01:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Twice。- Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.75,1:01:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you want to move a bit closer？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.29,1:01:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,To the Shrieking Shack？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.29,1:02:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I'm fine here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.33,1:02:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，well。Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.59,1:02:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You two shopping for your new dream home？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.90,1:02:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bit grand for you，isn't it，Weasle-Bee？Don't your family sleep in one room？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.60,1:02:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shut your mouth，Malfoy。- Not very friendly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.11,1:02:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boys，I think it's time we teach Weasle-Bee how to respect his superiors.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.38,1:02:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hope you don't mean yourself。- How dare you talk to me！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.98,1:02:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You filthy little mudblood！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.19,1:02:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.99,1:02:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't stand there！Do something！- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.15,1:03:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up，Malfoy？Lost your skis？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.39,1:03:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.29,1:03:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.06,1:03:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malfoy！Wait！Wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.87,1:03:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.97,1:03:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell，Harry。That was not funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.17,1:03:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those weasels！Never told me about any Marauder's Map.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.64,1:03:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,He won't keep it。He'll turn it over to Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.28,1:03:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aren't you？- Sure。Along with his Invisibility Cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.42,1:03:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look who it is。Madam Rosmerta.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.16,1:03:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron fancies her。- That's not true！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.59,1:03:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Professor McGonagall！- Cornelius！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.66,1:03:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allow me，minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.23,1:03:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，Hagrid… - Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.30,1:03:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rosmerta，my dear。I hope business is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'd be a lot better if the Ministry wasn't sending dementors…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.47,1:03:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …into my pub every other night！- We have…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.91,1:04:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We have a killer on the loose。- Sirius Black in Hogsmeade！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.44,1:04:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what would bring him here？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry Potter。- Harry Potter？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.72,1:04:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.47,1:04:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No underage wizards allowed in today！- Shut the damn door！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.14,1:04:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So rude。- Thick heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.37,1:04:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thick heads？！- How dare they！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.14,1:04:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who are they calling thick heads？- Young whippersnappers！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.08,1:04:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody will come to a pub where they'll get scared out of their wits.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.15,1:04:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore doesn't want dementors around the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.86,1:04:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me what this is all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.82,1:04:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Years ago，when Harry Potter's parents realized they were marked for death…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.50,1:04:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember？They hid。Few knew where they were.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.37,1:04:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,One who did was Sirius Black。And he told You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.40,1:05:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not only did Black lead him to the Potters that night…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.81,1:05:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he also killed Peter Pettigrew！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.38,1:05:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Peter Pettigrew？- Little lump of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.75,1:05:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Always trailing after Black。- I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.15,1:05:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never let James and Sirius out of his sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.15,1:05:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happened？- Peter tried to warn the Potters…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.05,1:05:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and might have，had he not run into an old friend，Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.46,1:05:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Black was vicious。He didn't kill Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.49,1:05:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He destroyed him！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.30,1:05:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,A finger。That's all that was left。A finger。Nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.24,1:05:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius Black may not have put his hands to the Potters…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.23,1:05:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …but he's the reason they're dead。- He wants to finish things.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.84,1:05:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't believe it。- That's not the worst of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.88,1:05:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What could be worse？- This：Sirius Black was…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.85,1:05:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and remains to this day…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.42,1:05:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Harry Potter's godfather！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.70,1:05:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，look！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.74,1:06:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sorry。Excuse me，excuse me。- Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.74,1:06:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，what happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.08,1:06:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was their friend…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.72,1:06:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and he betrayed them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.75,1:06:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was their friend！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.96,1:07:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope he finds me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.56,1:07:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because when he does，I'm gonna be ready！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.40,1:07:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,When he does，I'm gonna kill him！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.25,1:07:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.38,1:07:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you are。You came.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.42,1:07:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this，Harry？This is very advanced magic…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.46,1:07:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…well beyond the Ordinary Wizarding Level.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.09,1:07:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.19,1:07:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，everything's prepared.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.93,1:07:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The spell I'm going to teach you is called the Patronus Charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.50,1:07:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you ever hear of it？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.00,1:07:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Patronus is a positive force。For the wizard who conjures one…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.74,1:07:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it works like a shield，with the dementor feeding on it rather than him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.55,1:07:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,But in order for it to work，you need to think of a memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.55,1:08:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not just any memory，a very happy memory，a very powerful memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.72,1:08:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you do this？Yes。Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.73,1:08:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.73,1:08:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.90,1:08:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Explore your past.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.50,1:08:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have a memory？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.97,1:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Allow it to fill you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lose yourself within it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.24,1:08:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then speak the incantation，Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.02,1:08:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Expecto Patronum。- Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.66,1:08:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall we？Wand at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.81,1:09:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expecto… Expecto…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.78,1:09:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expect…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.52,1:09:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we go。Come on。Sit up。Deep breaths.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.89,1:09:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right。I didn't expect you to do it the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.10,1:09:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would have been remarkable。Here，eat this。You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's one nasty dementor。- Oh，no，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.17,1:09:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a boggart，Harry。A boggart.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.08,1:09:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,The real thing would be worse。Much，much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.41,1:09:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a matter of interest，what were you thinking？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.21,1:09:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which memory did you choose？- The first time I rode a broom.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.12,1:09:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not good enough。Not nearly good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.33,1:09:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's another。It's not happy，exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.57,1:10:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.84,1:10:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the happiest I've ever felt…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.58,1:10:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …but it's complicated。- Is it strong？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.92,1:10:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then let's give it a try。You feel ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.56,1:10:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.37,1:10:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.40,1:11:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.50,1:11:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Harry。Well done！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.44,1:11:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think I've had enough for today。- Yes。Sit down。Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.71,1:11:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eat this，it helps。It really helps.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.31,1:11:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,And just so you know，Harry…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.25,1:11:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I think you'd have given your father a run for his money。And that…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.42,1:11:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is saying something.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.65,1:11:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was thinking of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.82,1:11:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.16,1:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seeing their faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.03,1:11:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.90,1:11:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.37,1:11:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the memory I chose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.30,1:11:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't even know if it's real.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.24,1:11:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's the best I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.65,1:11:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Beautiful day。- Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.15,1:11:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless you've been ripped to pieces！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.29,1:12:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,835 Ripped to pieces？What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.89,1:12:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ronald has lost his rat。- I haven't lost anything！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.23,1:12:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your cat killed him！- Rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.56,1:12:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，you've seen the way that bloodthirsty beast of hers…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.07,1:12:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is always lurking about。And Scabbers is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.14,1:12:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，maybe you should take better care of your pets！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.18,1:12:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your cat killed him！- Did not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.41,1:12:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did。- Didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.95,1:12:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did it go，Hagrid？The hearing？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.75,1:12:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，first off，the committee members took turns…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.22,1:12:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…talking about why we were there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.76,1:12:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got up and did my piece。Said how Buckbeak…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.59,1:12:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…was a good hippogriff，always cleaned his feathers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.80,1:12:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then Lucius Malfoy got up。Well，you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.00,1:12:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said Buckbeak was a deadly and dangerous creature…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.37,1:12:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…who would kill you as soon as look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.61,1:12:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.11,1:12:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then he asked for the worst，did old Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.98,1:13:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're not sacking you！- No，I'm not sacked.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.22,1:13:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buckbeak's been sentenced to death！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.08,1:13:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spiders！There's… There's spiders。Spiders。They want me to tap-dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.82,1:13:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't wanna tap-dance！- You tell those spiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.56,1:13:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，yeah。Tell them。I'll tell them…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.68,1:14:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Peter Pettigrew？- Little lump of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.02,1:14:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Always trailing after Sirius Black。- Black was vicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.35,1:14:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,He didn't kill Pettigrew，he destroyed him！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.90,1:14:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Put that light out！- Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.61,1:15:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Watch it there，boy。- We're trying to sleep here！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.96,1:15:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mischief managed。Nox.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.76,1:15:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.26,1:15:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing wandering the corridors at night？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.97,1:15:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was sleepwalking.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.20,1:15:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,How extraordinarily like your father you are，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.00,1:15:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,He，too，was exceedingly arrogant，strutting about the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.94,1:15:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dad didn't strut。And nor do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.01,1:15:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，if you don't mind，I would appreciate it if you could lower your wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.65,1:15:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn out your pockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.16,1:15:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn out your pockets！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.69,1:15:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.50,1:16:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Spare bit of parchment。- Really？Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.37,1:16:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reveal your secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.81,1:16:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.72,1:16:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Messrs。Moony，Wormtail，Padfoot，and Prongs…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.42,1:16:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…offer their compliments to Professor Snape and…「
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.83,1:16:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.50,1:16:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「And request he keep his large nose out of other people's business.」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.60,1:16:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You insolent little… - Professor！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.77,1:16:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，well。Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.64,1:16:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out for a little walk in the moonlight，are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.71,1:16:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.35,1:16:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,That remains to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.65,1:17:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have now just confiscated a rather curious artifact.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.56,1:17:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take a look，Lupin。Supposed to be your area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.26,1:17:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Clearly，it's full of dark magic。- I seriously doubt it，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.23,1:17:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks as though it's a parchment designed to insult anyone…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.80,1:17:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…who tries to read it。I suspect it's a Zonko product.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.97,1:17:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nevertheless，I shall investigate any hidden qualities it may possess.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.38,1:17:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is，after all，as you say，my area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.68,1:17:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，would you come with me，please？Professor，good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.02,1:17:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you deaf？Put that light out！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.87,1:17:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.10,1:17:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't the faintest idea how this map came to be in your possession…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.51,1:17:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but quite frankly，I am astounded that you didn't hand it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.15,1:17:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did it never occur to you that this，in the hands of Sirius Black…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.81,1:18:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is a map to you？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.82,1:18:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.29,1:18:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father never set much store by the rules either.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.53,1:18:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he and your mother gave their lives to save yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.74,1:18:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…with a killer on the loose seems to me a poor way to repay them！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.41,1:18:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I will not cover up for you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.74,1:18:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you hear me？- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.35,1:18:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to return to your dormitory and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.18,1:18:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't take any detours。If you do，I shall know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.63,1:18:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor，just so you know，I don't think that map always works.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.93,1:18:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Earlier，it showed someone in the castle。Someone I know to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.30,1:18:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，really？And who might that be？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.21,1:18:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Peter Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.38,1:19:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.68,1:19:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.18,1:19:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good night，professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.39,1:19:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Broaden your minds。You must look beyond.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,The art of crystal gazing is in the clearing of the Inner Eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.33,1:19:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only then can you see。Try again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.20,1:19:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，what do we have here？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.64,1:19:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you mind me trying？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.25,1:19:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Grim，possibly.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.00,1:19:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dear，from the first moment you stepped foot in my class…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.30,1:19:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I sensed that you did not possess the proper spirit…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.63,1:19:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…for the noble art of Divination。No，you see，there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.70,1:19:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may be young in years，but your heart is as shriveled…as an old maid's，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.43,1:20:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,your soul as dry as the pages of the books…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.70,1:20:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to which you so desperately cleave.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.36,1:20:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have I said something？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.03,1:20:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's gone mental，Hermione has。Not that she wasn't always mental…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.20,1:20:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but now it's in the open for everyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.97,1:20:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.34,1:20:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We better take this back。- I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.54,1:20:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fine。See you later。- See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.72,1:21:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.86,1:21:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Professor Trelawney… - He will return tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.30,1:21:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.14,1:21:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight，he who betrayed his friends，whose heart rots with murder…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.94,1:21:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…shall break free.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.14,1:21:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Innocent blood shall be spilt…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.55,1:21:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and servant and master shall be reunited once more.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.89,1:22:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry，dear boy。Did you say something？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.96,1:22:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.20,1:22:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.35,1:23:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're going to kill Buckbeak。It's just too horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It just got worse。- What did I say？Father said…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.46,1:23:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I can keep the hippogriff's head。I'll donate it to the Gryffindors' room.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.83,1:23:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is going to be rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.47,1:23:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look who's here。- Come to see the show？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.83,1:23:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You！You foul，loathsome，evil little cockroach！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.10,1:23:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.44,1:23:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.79,1:23:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malfoy，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.06,1:23:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go。Quick。- Not a word to anyone，understood？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.43,1:23:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That felt good。- Not good，brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.29,1:24:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at him。Loves the smell of the trees when the wind blows through them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.76,1:24:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't we just set him free？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.19,1:24:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'd know it was me，and then Dumbledore…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.80,1:24:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…would get into trouble。He's coming down，Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.00,1:24:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Says he wants to be with me when they…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.37,1:24:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,When it happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.57,1:24:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great man，Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.91,1:24:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,A great man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.91,1:24:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll stay with you too。- You'll do no such thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.05,1:24:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think I want you seeing something like that？No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.42,1:24:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just drink your tea and be off。Oh。Before you do，Ron…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.50,1:24:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scabbers！You're alive！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.03,1:24:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keep a closer eye on your pet。- I think you owe someone an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.94,1:25:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Next time I see Crookshanks，I'll let him know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.87,1:25:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I meant me！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.64,1:25:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey。What was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.32,1:25:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.65,1:25:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，crikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.46,1:25:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，minister。Over this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.39,1:25:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's late。It's nearly dark。You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.66,1:25:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone sees you outside this time of night，you'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.60,1:25:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Particularly you，Harry。With you in a moment！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.61,1:25:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick。Quick！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.21,1:25:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.11,1:25:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It'll be fine。It'll be okay。- Go on，go on！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.88,1:25:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's ling you see over there… - On the slope.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.85,1:25:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On the slope… Ah，Hagrid。- Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.69,1:25:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good evening。- Minister。Make your way through.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.59,1:25:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have a tea，if you like。- No，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.53,1:26:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Gentlemen。- I'd like a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.30,1:26:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I think we should get down to our business，shall we？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.80,1:26:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well。It is the decision of the Committee for the Disposal…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.57,1:26:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of Dangerous Creatures that the hippogriff Buckbeak…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.91,1:26:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,…hereinafter called 「the condemned」，shall be executed this day at sundown.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.58,1:26:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dear，dear… - Now，now，Hagrid。Now，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.32,1:26:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right。It'll be all right。- The execution shall dispatch…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.89,1:26:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.79,1:26:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought I just saw…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.06,1:26:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Never mind。- Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.30,1:26:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buckbeak didn't mean no harm.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.12,1:27:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.50,1:27:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,He bit me。Scabbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.30,1:27:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron。Ron！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.20,1:27:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron！- Scabbers，come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.24,1:27:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.92,1:28:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scabbers，you bit me！- Harry，you do realize what tree this is？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.39,1:28:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not good。Ron，run！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.83,1:28:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，Hermione，run！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.93,1:28:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the Grim！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.60,1:28:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry！- Ron！Ron，wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.84,1:28:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.41,1:28:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Help！- Ron！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.92,1:28:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron。Ron。- Ron！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.03,1:28:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.97,1:28:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.41,1:29:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Duck！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.01,1:29:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.23,1:29:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，I'm sorry。- Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.40,1:30:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where do you suppose this goes？- I have a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just hope I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.03,1:30:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in the Shrieking Shack，aren't we？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.30,1:30:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.28,1:30:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.21,1:30:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron。You're okay。- The dog。Where is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.05,1:30:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a trap。He's the dog。He's an Animagus.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you want to kill Harry，you have to kill us too！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.10,1:31:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Only one will die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.10,1:31:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then it'll be you！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.25,1:31:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill me，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.62,1:31:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.19,1:31:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，well，Sirius。Looking rather ragged，aren't we？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.56,1:31:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally，the flesh reflects the madness within.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.20,1:31:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you'd know all about the madness within，wouldn't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.24,1:31:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I found him。- I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.21,1:31:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's here。- I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.91,1:31:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's kill him！- No！I trusted you！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.55,1:31:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And all this time，you've been his friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.99,1:32:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a werewolf！That's why he's been missing classes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.86,1:32:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long have you known？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.06,1:32:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Since Professor Snape set the essay。- Well，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.47,1:32:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are the brightest witch of your age I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.60,1:32:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough talk，Remus！Come on，let's kill him！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.20,1:32:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait！- I did my waiting！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.97,1:32:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twelve years of it！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.01,1:32:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,In Azkaban！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.89,1:32:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well。Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.19,1:32:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,But wait one more minute。Harry has the right to know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.13,1:32:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.93,1:32:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You betrayed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.33,1:32:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're the reason they're dead！- No，it wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.44,1:32:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody did betray your parents…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.50,1:32:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…somebody who，until quite recently，I believed to be dead！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.21,1:32:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who was it，then？- Peter Pettigrew！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.85,1:32:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he's in this room！Right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.48,1:33:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come out，come out，Peter！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.62,1:33:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come out，come out and play！- Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.56,1:33:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vengeance is sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.00,1:33:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,How I hoped I'd be the one to catch you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.66,1:33:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.20,1:33:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told Dumbledore you were helping a friend into the castle。Here's the proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.10,1:33:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant，Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.60,1:33:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You put your keen mind to the task and come to the wrong conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.18,1:33:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse us，Remus and I have business…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.01,1:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …to attend to。- Give me a reason。I beg you！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.18,1:33:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't be a fool。- He can't help it。It's habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.99,1:33:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Be quiet。- Be quiet yourself！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.72,1:33:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You two，quarrelling like an old married couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.32,1:33:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run along and play with your chemistry set！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.39,1:33:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could do it，you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.36,1:33:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,But why deny the dementors？They're so longing to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.20,1:33:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I detect a flicker of fear？Oh，yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.07,1:33:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Dementor's Kiss。One can only imagine what that must be like.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.71,1:34:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's said to be nearly unbearable to witness，but I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.35,1:34:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.62,1:34:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.06,1:34:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.56,1:34:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry！What did you just do？- You attacked a teacher！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.37,1:34:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tell me about Peter。- He was at school with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.10,1:34:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We thought he was our friend！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.97,1:34:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。Pettigrew's dead。You killed him！- No，he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.11,1:34:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought so too，until you mentioned Pettigrew on the map！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.54,1:34:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The map was lying，then。- The map never lies！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.51,1:34:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pettigrew's alive！And he's right there！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.95,1:34:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Me？！He's mental！- Not you！Your rat！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.82,1:34:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scabbers has been in my family for… - Twelve years？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.13,1:34:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Curiously long life for a common garden rat！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.79,1:34:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's missing a toe，isn't he？- So what？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.56,1:34:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All they could find of Pettigrew was his… - Finger！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.73,1:35:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dirty coward cut it off so everyone would think he was dead！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.17,1:35:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And then he transformed into a rat！- Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.78,1:35:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give it to him，Ron。- What are you trying to do to him？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.05,1:35:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scabbers！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.28,1:35:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave him alone！Get off him！What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.84,1:35:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remus？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.44,1:35:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.11,1:35:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,My old friends！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.65,1:35:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！Look at you。You look so much like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.66,1:35:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- James。We were the best of friends… - How dare you speak to Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.16,1:35:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,How dare you talk about James in front of him！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.00,1:36:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You sold James and Lily to Voldemort！- I didn't mean to！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.40,1:36:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord。You have no idea the weapons he possesses！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.40,1:36:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ask yourself，Sirius！What would you have done？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.41,1:36:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What would you have done？- Died，rather than betray my friends！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.18,1:36:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,James wouldn't have wanted me killed！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.75,1:36:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your dad would have spared me！He would have shown me mercy！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.92,1:36:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should have realized if Voldemort didn't kill you，we would。Together！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.33,1:36:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.87,1:36:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry，this man… - I know what he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.00,1:36:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we'll take him to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.10,1:36:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bless you，boy。Bless you！- Get off！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.28,1:36:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said we'd take you to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.05,1:36:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,After that，the dementors can have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.19,1:37:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry about the bite。I reckon that twinges a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.09,1:37:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,A bit？A bit？You almost tore my leg off！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.79,1:37:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was going for the rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.53,1:37:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Normally，I have a very sweet disposition as a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.53,1:37:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,More than once，James suggested that I make the change permanent.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.97,1:37:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tail I could live with。But the fleas，they're murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.39,1:37:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.90,1:37:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You better go。- No。Don't worry，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.60,1:37:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's fine。I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.80,1:37:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You go，I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.10,1:37:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- I'm fine。Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.77,1:37:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That looks really painful。- So painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.94,1:37:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,They might chop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.98,1:38:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure Madam Pomfrey will fix it in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.82,1:38:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too late。It's ruined。It'll have to be chopped off.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.29,1:38:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's beautiful，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.96,1:38:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the first time I walked through those doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.43,1:38:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be nice to do it again as a free man.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.73,1:38:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a noble thing you did back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.37,1:38:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He doesn't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.67,1:38:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't think my dad would have wanted his best friends…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.01,1:38:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to become killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.75,1:38:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，dead，the truth dies with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.62,1:38:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alive，you're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.15,1:38:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn me into a flobberworm。Anything but the dementors！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.46,1:38:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron！Haven't I been a good pet？You won't let them give me…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.96,1:38:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to the dementors，will you？I was your rat！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.63,1:38:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sweet，clever girl！Surely you won't… - Get away from her！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.13,1:38:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know if you know，Harry…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.20,1:38:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but when you were born，James and Lily made me your godfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.47,1:39:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.58,1:39:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can understand if you choose to stay with your aunt and uncle…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.81,1:39:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but if you ever wanted a different home…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.48,1:39:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Come and live with you？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.29,1:39:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a thought。I can understand if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.56,1:39:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.61,1:39:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remus，my old friend。Have you taken your potion tonight？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.61,1:39:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know the man you truly are，Remus！This heart is where you truly live！Here！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.32,1:39:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,This flesh is only flesh！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.46,1:39:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.64,1:40:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.30,1:40:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remus！Remus！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.45,1:40:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！Run！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.79,1:40:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。- Wait。Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.00,1:40:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hermione！- Bad idea。Bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.30,1:40:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.61,1:40:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Lupin？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.92,1:40:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice doggy。Nice doggy！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.59,1:40:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you are，Potter！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.92,1:41:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.79,1:41:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come back here，Potter！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.03,1:42:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.23,1:42:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Sirius！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.07,1:43:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.74,1:45:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.05,1:45:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.61,1:45:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.38,1:45:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,He sent the dementors away.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.08,1:45:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw him across the lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.69,1:45:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，they've captured Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.55,1:45:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any minute the dementors are gonna perform the Kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.56,1:45:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're gonna kill him？- No。It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.26,1:46:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.26,1:46:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're going to suck out his soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.33,1:46:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Headmaster，stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.90,1:46:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They've got the wrong man。- It's true。Sirius is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.47,1:46:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's Scabbers who did it。- Scabbers？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.81,1:46:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's my rat，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.61,1:46:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not really a rat。He was a rat。He was my brother Percy's rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.61,1:46:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But then they gave him an owl… - The point is，we know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.48,1:46:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Please believe us。- I do，Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.22,1:46:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the word of three 13-year-old wizards will convince few others.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.73,1:46:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,A child's voice，however honest and true…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.66,1:46:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is meaningless to those who have forgotten how to listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.64,1:46:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mysterious thing，time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.34,1:46:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Powerful…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.85,1:46:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and when meddled with，dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.32,1:46:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius Black is in the topmost cell of the Dark Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.75,1:47:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know the laws，Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.02,1:47:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must not be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.99,1:47:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you would do well，I feel，to return before this last chime.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.83,1:47:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,If not，the consequences are too ghastly to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.90,1:47:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you succeed tonight…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.90,1:47:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…more than one innocent life may be spared.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.54,1:47:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three turns should do it，I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.65,1:47:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.65,1:47:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,When in doubt，I find retracing my steps to be a wise place to begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.65,1:47:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.22,1:47:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the bloody hell was that all about？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.36,1:47:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Ron，but seeing as you can't walk…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.69,1:48:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,What just happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.46,1:48:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's Ron？- 7：30.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.93,1:48:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where were we at 7：30？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.96,1:48:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Going to Hagrid's？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.93,1:48:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。And we can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.40,1:48:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.42,1:48:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione！Hermione，wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.89,1:48:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，will you please tell me what it is we're doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.66,1:48:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You foul，loathsome，evil little cockroach！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.70,1:48:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's us.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.27,1:48:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，no！He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.37,1:48:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.11,1:49:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a Time-Turner，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.65,1:49:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,McGonagall gave it to me first term.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.01,1:49:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is how I've been getting to my lessons all year.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.58,1:49:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You mean we've gone back in time？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.95,1:49:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore obviously wanted us to return to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.63,1:49:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clearly，something happened he wants us to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.93,1:49:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.43,1:49:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.97,1:49:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malfoy's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.51,1:49:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Run。- Not a word to anyone，understood？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.31,1:49:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get that jumped-up mudblood！Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.55,1:49:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That felt good。- Not good，brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.40,1:49:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。We should be at Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.57,1:50:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。Buckbeak's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.58,1:50:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.65,1:50:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember what Dumbledore said？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.81,1:50:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we succeed，more than one innocent life could be spared.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.22,1:50:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.84,1:50:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here they come。I'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.11,1:50:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fudge has to see Buckbeak before we steal him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.78,1:50:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise，he'll think Hagrid set him free.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.28,1:50:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scabbers，you're alive！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.85,1:50:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keep a closer eye on your pet。- That's Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.86,1:50:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry，you can't。- He betrayed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.93,1:50:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't expect me to sit here。- Yes，and you must！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.80,1:51:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，you're in Hagrid's hut now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.70,1:51:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you go bursting in，you'll think you've gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.70,1:51:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Awful things happen to wizards who meddle with time.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.74,1:51:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.28,1:51:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fudge is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.92,1:51:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we aren't leaving？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.15,1:51:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why aren't we leaving？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.67,1:51:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you mad？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.24,1:51:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.81,1:51:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.00,1:52:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're coming out the back door。Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.08,1:52:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that really what my hair looks like from the back？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.96,1:52:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.16,1:52:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought I just saw…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.19,1:52:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Never mind。- Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.18,1:52:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，go，Harry。Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.72,1:53:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get away。Get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.88,1:53:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Minister，I really think I should sign as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.15,1:53:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，very well。Perhaps it would be…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.52,1:53:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Buckbeak。Come quickly。Come with us now。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.76,1:53:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep trying。Come on。Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.86,1:53:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buckbeak。Okay？Quickly。Hurry up。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.50,1:53:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your name only。- It's such a very long name…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.17,1:53:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry up now，Buckbeak，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.58,1:54:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Come on，Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.75,1:54:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come and get the nice dead ferret.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.68,1:54:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。It's here。Come on，Beaky。- Here we are，minister。Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.39,1:54:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now，look there。- Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.26,1:54:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look beyond the rocks。- What am I supposed to see？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.79,1:54:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dippet had that ling planted when he was headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.46,1:54:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，yes。Indeed，indeed。- And all the strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.30,1:54:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，Buckbeak。Come on。- I see no strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.27,1:54:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Over there。- Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.64,1:54:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Over there。- This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.61,1:54:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's get this over，please。- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.95,1:54:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,But where is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.58,1:54:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw the beast，just now.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.42,1:54:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not a moment ago！- How extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.79,1:54:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.32,1:54:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come now，Dumbledore。Someone's obviously released him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.59,1:54:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hagrid？- Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.13,1:54:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think the minister's suggesting you had anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.36,1:55:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,How could you？You've been with us all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.60,1:55:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。- Well，well…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.67,1:55:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We must search the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.34,1:55:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，search the skies，if you must，minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.54,1:55:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meanwhile，I'd like a nice cup of tea or a large brandy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.15,1:55:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，executioner，your services are no longer required.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.32,1:55:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.39,1:55:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll find no small glasses in this house，professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.50,1:55:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。- This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.78,1:55:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way，now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.98,1:55:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now what？- We save Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.92,1:55:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How？- No idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.73,1:56:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look。It's Lupin。- Immobulus！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.57,1:56:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Snape's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.74,1:56:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.61,1:56:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.98,1:56:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- At least someone's enjoying himself。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.05,1:56:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hermione？- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.99,1:57:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before，down by the lake，when I was with Sirius…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.49,1:57:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I did see someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.79,1:57:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That someone made the dementors go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.40,1:57:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,With a Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.90,1:57:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard Snape telling Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.97,1:57:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,According to him…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.60,1:57:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…only a really powerful wizard could have conjured it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.20,1:57:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.17,1:57:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dad conjured the Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.14,1:57:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry，but your dad's… - Dead。I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.81,1:57:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.29,1:57:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we come.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.59,1:57:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see Sirius talking to me there？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.13,1:57:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's asking me to come live with him。- That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.23,1:57:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we free him，I'll never have to go back to the Dursleys'.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.64,1:57:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll just be me and him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.94,1:57:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,We could live in the country…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.04,1:57:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…someplace you can see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.84,1:57:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll like that after all those years in Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.71,1:58:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.82,1:58:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.43,1:58:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.51,1:58:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- Saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.09,1:58:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.32,1:58:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Great。Now he's coming for us。- Yeah，I didn't think about that。Run！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.50,2:00:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was so scary.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.40,2:00:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poor Professor Lupin's having a really tough night.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.78,2:00:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.97,2:00:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is horrible。- Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.17,2:00:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dad will come。He'll conjure the Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.15,2:00:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.19,2:00:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right there。You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.62,2:00:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，listen to me。No one's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.29,2:01:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，he will。He will come.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.00,2:01:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sirius。- You're dying…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.50,2:01:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.41,2:01:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.04,2:01:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.54,2:02:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were right，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.28,2:02:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't my dad I saw earlier。It was me！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.78,2:02:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw myself conjuring the Patronus before.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.72,2:02:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew I could do it this time because…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.25,2:02:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…well，I had already done it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.12,2:02:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Does that make sense？- No.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.76,2:02:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I don't like flying！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.74,2:02:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bombarda！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.37,2:03:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be forever grateful for this…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.34,2:03:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.84,2:03:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I want to go with you。- One day，perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.95,2:03:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,For some time，my life will be too unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.02,2:03:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And besides…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.69,2:03:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …you're meant to be here。- But you're innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.16,2:03:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.36,2:03:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And for now，that will do.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.56,2:03:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I expect you're tired of hearing this…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.13,2:03:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but you look so like your father.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.37,2:03:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.34,2:04:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You have… - My mother's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.58,2:04:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's cruel that I spent so much time with James and Lily，and you so little.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.28,2:04:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,But know this：
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.89,2:04:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ones that love us never really leave us.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.43,2:04:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you can always find them…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.80,2:04:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.04,2:04:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really are the brightest witch of your age.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.37,2:05:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.30,2:05:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well？- He's free。We did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.17,2:05:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did what？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.87,2:05:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.58,2:05:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you get there？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.08,2:05:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was talking to you there。And now you're there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.09,2:05:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's he talking about，Harry？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.89,2:05:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，Ron。How can somebody be in two places at once？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.92,2:06:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.03,2:06:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw you coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.43,2:06:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've looked worse，believe me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.87,2:06:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You've been sacked。- No.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.17,2:06:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I resigned，actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.31,2:06:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Resigned？Why？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.25,2:06:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it seems that somebody let slip the nature of my condition.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.72,2:07:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,This time tomorrow，the owls will start arriving and parents will not want…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.39,2:07:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…well，someone like me teaching their children.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.99,2:07:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But Dumbledore… - He has already…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.06,2:07:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…risked enough on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.10,2:07:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，people like me are…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.00,2:07:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，let's just say that I'm used to it by now.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.88,2:07:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you look so miserable，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.62,2:07:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of it made any difference.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.99,2:07:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pettigrew escaped。- Didn't make any difference？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.69,2:07:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It made all the difference in the world。You uncovered the truth.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.36,2:07:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saved an innocent man from a terrible fate.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.23,2:07:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It made a great deal of difference.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.40,2:07:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I am proud of anything…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.74,2:07:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it is of how much you have learned this year.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.58,2:07:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，since I am no longer your teacher…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.51,2:08:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I feel no guilt whatsoever about giving this back to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.65,2:08:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,So now I'll say goodbye，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.32,2:08:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I feel sure we'll meet again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.46,2:08:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until then…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.13,2:08:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…mischief managed.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.09,2:08:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand back，I said！Or I'll take it upstairs if you don't settle.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.47,2:08:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.70,2:08:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wherever did you get it？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.30,2:08:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I have a go，Harry？After you，of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.84,2:08:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about？- Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.17,2:09:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let the man through。I didn't mean to open it，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.64,2:09:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was badly wrapped。They made me do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.31,2:09:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did not.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.18,2:09:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's a Firebolt。- It's the fastest broom in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.85,2:09:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,For me？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.59,2:09:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But who sent it？- No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.29,2:09:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,This came with it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.03,2:09:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go on，Harry！- Yeah，let's see.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.90,2:09:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,How fast is it，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.05,2:09:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.86,2:09:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I solemnly swear that I am up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:17.85,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与阿兹卡班囚徒》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利…哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利…快开门
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.玛姬.见到你真高兴…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗农姨夫.请在这张表上签个字
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么.学校里的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是守规矩.我就签
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要玛姬不忘守规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔…你还住在这儿.是吗？ - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听.“当然”.你这没良心的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟心肠好收留你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是换了我 我就把他送到孤儿院去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦.那是我的小达力.是我的宝贝小侄子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯.来亲一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把玛姬的行李搬上楼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来.帮妈妈吃完吧 我的宝贝儿.好乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来杯酒吗？.玛姬 - 就一小杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,点心棒极了.佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,再倒一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要照顾几条小狗… 吃得也就马虎了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来点.这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊.你想尝一小口白兰地吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的乖乖小宝贝.它的味道棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你傻笑什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你送他去哪儿来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣布鲁斯 不可救药的孩子去那个学校正合适
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿不规矩要被藤条抽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔.是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都被抽了好几回了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我可不爱听那些废话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么别打那些该打的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不要为这不争气的小子太自责.弗农
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是遗传的 孽种的缺陷是藏不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子的父亲是干嘛的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不干嘛.他…他没有工作 被辞退了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定还是个酒鬼 - 胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？ - 我爸爸不是酒鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系.别大惊小怪 是我握得太紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该上床睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吵 你…弄干净
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 跟他父亲没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怪就怪他母亲 反正狗就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是母狗出了问题 那么生出来的小狗就一定有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴.给我闭嘴…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你们吧.你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗农
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗农…快点想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你了.玛姬.抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能放手 - 滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别放手！ - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗农
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.上帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她弄回来.快把她弄回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恢复原状 - 不.她这是活该！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闪开.离我远点 - 你在校外不能使魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？那就试试 - 他们不会让你回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎.哪儿都比这儿好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎乘坐骑士大巴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是应急车 运送陷入困境的魔法师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫斯坦·桑帕克 今晚我将做你的售票员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐在地上干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我摔倒了 - 没事干嘛要摔倒？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我又不是故意的 - 那就起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在这儿瞎耽误工夫了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在看什么？ - 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快上车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃.不不不.我搬行李.你上车
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点.往前.往前.往前…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开车吧.厄恩 - 对.开车吧.厄恩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是一次颠簸的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚才你说你叫什么名字？ - 我没说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪儿？ - 破釜酒吧.在伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗.厄恩？ 破釜酒吧.在伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,破釜酒吧.若给你豌豆汤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要在它吃掉你之前吃掉它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些麻瓜…他们看不见我们吗？ - 麻瓜？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么都看不见.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对.不过用叉子猛戳 他们有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二点方向有个老太太
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,十.九.八…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,七.六.五.四…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,三.二点五…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,二.一.零点七…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会… 没听过小天狼星布莱克吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是杀人犯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为杀人被关进了阿兹卡班监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么逃跑的？ - 噢.这的确让人费解
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是第一个成功越狱的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.73,0:11:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最最支持的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定听说过他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二点方向有两辆双层巴士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我们越来越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们前面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位.各位？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛拉长脸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶.耶.快到了…快到了…快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 破釜酒吧到了 - 下一站.翻倒巷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利波特先生.我们又见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开车吧.厄恩 - 开车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一号房间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的猫头鹰真聪明.波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比你早五分钟飞到这儿来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为魔法部部长.我有责任告诉你 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚早些时候… 有人看见你姨夫的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在谢菲尔的南边围着一根烟囱打转
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,部里当即派遣逆转偶发事件司前去现场处理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经被恢复原状.那段记忆也被抹去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件事.她一点都不会记起。全都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以圆满解决
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且丝毫没有损害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,豌豆汤？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用.谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 部长先生？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不明白 - 不明白？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我违法了.我是不能在家中使用魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了.不会因为有人把姑妈吹成气球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把他关进阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来.像你那么离家出走 在目前的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是非常非常不负责任的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目前的情况指什么？ - 有个杀人犯越狱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星布莱克？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有关系 你很安全.这才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你又将启程回霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃.这些是你的新课本 我自作主张
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们一起带来交给你； 现在.汤姆会带你去房间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃.随便说一句.哈利。你在这儿的时候.最好不要到处…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！到底你要不要开走？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:15.15,Title,0,0,0,0,,《妖怪们的妖怪书》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,客房服务
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会儿再来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那畜生离斑斑远一点 不然我就把他变成茶壶保暖套
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是只猫，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 猫天生就这样 - 这叫猫.你管这叫猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看着就像一头长毛猪 - 真可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的臭耗子像鞋刷还说别人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系.克鲁克山 不用理那坏小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃及？那儿什么样？ - 有好多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:17:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,木乃伊、古墓… 斑斑也玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以前埃及人崇拜猫 - 对.还崇拜屎壳郎咧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又在显摆你的剪报了.罗恩 - 我没给人看过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.还说没有人呢.除非你忘了汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早班女佣 - 夜班女佣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厨师 - 修马桶的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 韦斯莱太太
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你真高兴 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要的都带了吗？ - 带了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？所有的书… - 都在楼上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有的衣服？ - 一切都在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好孩子 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈里波特 - 韦斯莱先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利.能跟你说句话吗？ - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫敏 - 早.韦斯莱先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 期待着新学期？ - 是呀.一定带劲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.魔法部里有些人… 会强烈反对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把接下来要说的这件事向你透露
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我认为你应该了解真相
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大的危险
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟小天狼星布莱克有关吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克的事你知道多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只知道他越狱了 - 知道为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,十三年前.当你阻止了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伏地魔 - 别提他的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你阻止了… 神秘人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克就失去了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今天。他仍然是一个忠实的仆人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以.在他的眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.31,0:18:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是中间唯一挡道的 阻碍了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘人…卷土重来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为这个.他才会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从阿兹卡班逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你向我发誓.无论你听到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不会去找布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要去找一个想要杀我的人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想把她吹大 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是失控了 - 帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩.这可不好玩 幸好哈利没被开除
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说幸好我没被逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是觉得帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧.别处坐满了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.61,0:19:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- l.J.卢平教授 - 你什么都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么什么都知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的箱子上写着呢 - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.35,0:19:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他真的睡着了吗？ - 应该是吧.怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们说件事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让我们先搞清楚 布莱克从阿兹卡班逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是为了追杀你 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会被抓住的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有人都在找他 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 以前没有人能从阿兹卡班逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再说.他是杀人成性的疯子 - 多谢.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么停了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道.也许是故障
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.你踩我脚了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有东西在动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…有人要上车
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼.怎么回事呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给.吃这个.会管用的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿.是巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.65,0:22:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚…刚才那个是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.89,0:23:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个摄魂怪.阿兹卡班的看守之一
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在车厢里找小天狼星布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失陪一会儿 得去跟司机说句话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧.会好些
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你全身僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.71,0:23:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还以为你癫痫病发作了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.65,0:23:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…你们是不是也…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知觉了？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.36,0:23:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可感觉怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像再也没了快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人尖叫.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:16.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（霍格莫德）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来霍格沃茨度过新学年
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有几句话要说…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁大家还没被这美味大餐弄得迷迷糊糊的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先.欢迎新来的教授l.J.卢平
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.51,0:25:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他欣然同意填补空缺
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授黑魔法防御术这门课程
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运.教授
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.89,0:25:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得他知道该给你吃巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.39,0:25:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿.波特 听说你昏过去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是真的昏过去了？ - 你滚开.马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.10,0:25:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么会知道的？ - 我哪知道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特尔·博恩教授多年来 一直教授保护神奇生物课
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经决定退休
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便有更多的时间来照料残留的肢体
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所幸的是.我荣幸地宣布
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,已有人接替他的职位.而且不是别人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是我们的鲁伯·海格
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:26:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后.有件更为严肃的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在魔法部的要求下…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨将由一些来自 阿兹卡班的摄魂怪看守
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.88,0:26:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到小天狼星布莱克被捕的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄魂怪将驻守在学校的每一个入口
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我已得到保证
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的出现不会打乱我们的日常生活
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.79,0:26:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我提醒诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.32,0:26:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是凶残的生物.不会区分
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.66,0:26:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们要追捕的人和挡它们道的人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.23,0:26:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我必须警告在座的每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.07,0:26:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它们找到理由伤害你们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.47,0:26:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些摄魂怪天生就不知道什么是原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们.总能找到快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至在最黑暗的时期
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.99,0:26:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你们记得…把灯点亮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.90,0:27:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[开门咒] 否琼勒米杰
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿.听着.她不让我进去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.58,0:27:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [开门咒] 否琼勒米杰 - 哦…不…等等…等等
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧这个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.26,0:27:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 了不起.我的歌喉震碎的 - [开门咒] 否琼勒米杰
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那好吧.进来吧 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.04,0:27:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪.都三年了.她还在吊嗓子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.17,0:27:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她五音不全 - 的确太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿.朋友 - 呃.呃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.75,0:27:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 太真可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿.那是绿的.那是猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么呀？ - 那他也是猴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.89,0:28:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再给他糖了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.26,0:28:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿.纳威.尝尝大象
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩.接着 - 我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,够厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.98,0:28:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不…别尝那个 - 嗬.那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快瞧瞧他的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.09,0:29:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎我的孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.53,0:29:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这儿 你们将探究占卜.几种卓越的法术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.84,0:29:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这儿 你们将知道自己是否具备视野
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.54,0:29:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我是教授特里劳妮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里.我们将一起学习如何预知未来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这学期.我们的重点是探索麦迪 解读茶叶术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.49,0:29:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请和坐在你对面的同学交换茶杯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.56,0:29:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见什么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.13,0:29:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相暗藏着 犹如藏在书中的句子.等人来解读
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可首先必须开阔思路
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:30:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 首先眼光必须放远 - 简直一派胡言
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.31,0:30:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你哪儿冒出来的？ - 我？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一直都在 - 我说孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你奶奶身体好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.18,0:30:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我看不一定 杯子拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,开阔思路
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的光环经过死神 你是不在彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想是的 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着杯子.说你看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.44,0:30:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.97,0:30:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个歪十字架 那代表考验和苦难
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.81,0:30:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿.另外.可能是太阳 那代表快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.18,0:30:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会受苦 可同时你会很快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.42,0:30:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,杯子拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.33,0:30:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.30,0:30:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有…不详
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.60,0:31:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不强？什么叫不强？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.51,0:31:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是不强.白痴.是不详
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.54,0:31:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,外形是一条凶恶的大狗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们世界最恶毒的征兆
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.91,0:31:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它预示着
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.75,0:31:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.22,0:31:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说那个不祥和小天狼星布莱克有关吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.13,0:31:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话.罗恩.我看… 占卜学实在经不起推敲
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.23,0:31:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实.古代儒尼文 那门课才真有意思呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代儒尼文？ 你这学期你要学几门课？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.37,0:31:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好几门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.21,0:31:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃.等等.这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.47,0:31:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代儒尼文和占卜课是同一时间
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.38,0:31:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得同一时间上两门课
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.55,0:31:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 没人能同一时间上两门课
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.12,0:31:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开阔你们的思路 用你们的天目看未来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了.都过来.都走近些 请不要讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.66,0:32:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天让你们一饱眼福
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.66,0:32:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,精彩的一课.请跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.94,0:32:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了.同学们.请安静 在哪儿站成一组
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.18,0:32:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把书翻到49页
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这书怎么打开呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.68,0:32:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然得先把书捋一捋了 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.93,0:32:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这么没用.隆巴顿 - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.44,0:32:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些书真滑稽 - 噢.是呀.滑稽死了.设计巧妙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.87,0:32:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这学校再这样下去就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.54,0:32:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸要知道邓布利多 让这混蛋教课就热闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴.马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄魂怪…摄魂怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别管他 - 你应该捋一捋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.95,0:33:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是很漂亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.12,0:33:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来认识一下巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.36,0:33:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格.这是什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鹰头马身有翼兽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.00,0:33:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们要了解的是 它们非常傲慢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,脾气可不好惹 千万别羞辱鹰头马身兽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.81,0:33:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄不好会搭上你的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:34:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在.谁来跟它打个招呼？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.62,0:34:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得尊重礼让.这是礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.83,0:34:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以.走上前.向它鞠个躬
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.93,0:34:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后等着.看它是不是还礼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还礼.你才能摸它
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话… 好吧好吧好吧.过会儿再说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.71,0:34:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在向它鞠躬
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.31,0:34:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再低些
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,往后退.哈利.退后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.85,0:34:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.02,0:34:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好.哈利.干得好 嘿.你个大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.18,0:35:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在.你可以上去拍拍它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧.别害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.15,0:35:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,要轻轻地.慢慢地.慢慢地
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.96,0:35:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么快.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.50,0:35:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.94,0:35:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻轻地.我慢慢的让它靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻轻的…慢慢的…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.51,0:35:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再慢点…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.91,0:35:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.85,0:35:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好.干得好.哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.42,0:35:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.62,0:35:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在它愿意让你骑 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.22,0:35:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 嘿！嘿！嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.93,0:35:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你抱上去.坐在翅膀关节的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:36:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拔它的羽毛.它会谢你的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.94,0:37:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.得了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.11,0:37:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.11,0:37:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我今天的课怎么样？ - 一级棒.教授
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.72,0:38:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不危险.对吗？ 丑八怪！大怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.16,0:38:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.43,0:38:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要.马尔福！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.63,0:38:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.43,0:38:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！哇！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.77,0:38:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.70,0:38:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这笨畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.24,0:38:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咹.它杀了我.它杀了我 - 冷静些.只是皮肉伤
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.54,0:38:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.88,0:38:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 必须立刻送他去医院 - 我是老师.我来送
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.15,0:38:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我…我…会让你后悔的… - 现在下课
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.19,0:38:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你那该死的野鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.95,0:39:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很疼.马尔福？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,时好时坏.不过.我还是命大
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.22,0:39:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞弗雷夫人说再拖上一两分钟 胳膊就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.89,0:39:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我就几星期不能做功课了 - 听听这白痴说的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还真越说越离谱了 - 至少海格没被开除
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我听说马尔福的爸爸很凶啊 这事儿还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.44,0:39:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人看见他了！看见他了！ - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.47,0:39:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.24,0:39:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,达福镇？离这儿可不远
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.61,0:39:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会来霍格沃茨吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.41,0:39:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 入口有摄魂怪把守 - 摄魂怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.08,0:39:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经让它溜了一次 谁敢保证不会有第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.62,0:39:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对.他神出鬼没的 抓他就像抓烟雾
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的手抓烟雾
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.25,0:40:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很奇妙？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.56,0:40:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有哪位同学能猜一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.50,0:40:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是一个博格特？ - 很好.托马斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁能告诉我 博格特长什么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.41,0:40:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人知道 - 它几时来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.67,0:40:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格特会变形
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.38,0:40:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到它的人，心里最怕什么 它就会变成什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.78,0:40:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以它们是那么的… - 那么的恐怖…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.38,0:40:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所幸的是 有一个很简单的咒语就能击退博格特
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.22,0:40:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来练习 请先别用魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.29,0:40:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我念.瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:41:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞地肯尤拉 - 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,再响亮些.要说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.07,0:41:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听好.瑞地肯尤拉斯 - 瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.47,0:41:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听得像溜得快拉屎 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.77,0:41:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就先练到这儿吧 要知道单靠咒语是不够的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.94,0:41:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正能把博格特击垮的是… 大笑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.88,0:41:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得强迫它变成你们认为… 真正可笑的形象
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.45,0:41:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来解释 纳威.请你过来.好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.82,0:41:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧.别害羞.来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.13,0:41:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.30,0:41:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰.纳威 你最害怕的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.00,0:41:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.90,0:41:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普教授？是的.都怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.47,0:41:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是和奶奶一块儿住的？ - 是的.我也不想博格特变成她的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.45,0:41:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.88,0:41:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在想想奶奶是怎么穿戴的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.92,0:41:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想她的穿戴.而且要想清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.35,0:41:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她拿一只红色的手袋 - 不需要说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.59,0:42:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要你看见.我们就能看 我打开衣柜的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.70,0:42:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会要你这么做…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.47,0:42:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想斯内普教授穿着你奶奶的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.60,0:42:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能做到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.90,0:42:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始.魔杖准备
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一、二、三
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.19,0:42:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想.纳威.快想
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.83,0:42:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.47,0:42:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了.纳威.好极了 不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.30,0:42:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,都往后退.大家排好队
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.44,0:42:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,排好队
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.95,0:42:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要每个人都想出自己最害怕的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.55,0:42:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把它变得很可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.85,0:43:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.79,0:43:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中思想.面对恐惧.勇敢些
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.84,0:43:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖准备
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.11,0:43:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.08,0:43:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了.瞧见了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.05,0:43:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好.非常好太精采了.很好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.45,0:43:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这实在是让人乐不可支 帕瓦蒂.快上
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.57,0:43:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌.千万别慌
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.14,0:43:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个.往前走….往前走…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.18,0:44:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！好极了！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.03,0:44:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.00,0:44:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.31,0:44:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯.好吧.非常抱歉.今天就练到这儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.41,0:44:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,都去后面拿回自己的书
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.58,0:44:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,课就上到这儿.谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.39,0:44:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉。好了.走吧.别玩物丧志
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.42,0:44:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在记住 去霍格莫德村应该是一种荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.30,0:44:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有谁在学校的表现欠佳.那么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.30,0:44:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不再享受这份特殊的待遇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.70,0:45:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,座位表上没签字.就不能去那个村
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.17,0:45:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是规定
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.94,0:45:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,表上签了字的跟我来 没签字的别跟来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.28,0:45:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授.我想.如果你签了字 那我就能去了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.95,0:45:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能签 只有家长或监护人可以签
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.62,0:45:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不是.那就不能签
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起.波特.我的决定不会变
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.93,0:45:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能一起去了.回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.98,0:45:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授.我能问个问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.21,0:45:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要问我为什么阻止你 对付那博格特.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.28,0:45:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是.我想当然地认为
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.85,0:45:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会变成伏地魔的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.86,0:45:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始是想到了…伏地魔 可后来想起
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.59,0:45:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚在火车上
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.40,0:45:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遇见摄魂怪 - 我记得
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.10,0:46:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明你最害怕的.是恐惧本身
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.17,0:46:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺合乎情理
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.84,0:46:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我晕倒前
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.17,0:46:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了一个声音
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.71,0:46:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.74,0:46:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.31,0:46:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄魂怪逼我们 想起那些最糟糕的往事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.75,0:46:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的痛苦成了它们的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.52,0:46:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是妈妈在尖叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.89,0:46:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,被杀的那个晚的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.72,0:46:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实.我第一次见到你的时候就认出了你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.80,0:46:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是看你的疤.而是眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.07,0:46:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.17,0:46:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.94,0:46:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,咹.是啊.我认识她
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.24,0:46:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遭人冷落时.你妈妈帮助了我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.28,0:46:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不仅是个天赋秉异的女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.68,0:46:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个极其善良的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.52,0:46:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能发现别人的美 她尤其能看出那些…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.76,0:47:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些连别人自己都还没发现的美
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.40,0:47:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的父亲詹姆斯却截然不同
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.30,0:47:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.34,0:47:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的天赋似乎是招惹麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.94,0:47:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这天赋…据说后来遗传给了你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.45,0:47:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你实在太像你的父母了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.26,0:47:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这总有一天你会明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.83,0:47:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂蜜公爵糖果店真没说的 可哪家都比不上佐科笑话店
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.47,0:47:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我没去成尖叫屋.那是全…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鬼屋 - 全英国闹鬼最厉害的 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.61,0:47:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼.也许是纳威又把口令忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.85,0:47:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！ - 咹.你谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.45,0:48:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我过去 对不起.我是男生会主席
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.35,0:48:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,往后退.都往后退
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.22,0:48:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,宿舍要彻底搜查.谁都不准进去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.53,0:48:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是胖夫人.她不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.00,0:48:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见最好.她唱歌像杀猪叫
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.60,0:48:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不好玩.罗恩 - 大家都镇静！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.54,0:48:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格兰芬多的同学回公共休息室 - 都安静.校长来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.95,0:48:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.11,0:48:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开.闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.35,0:48:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.50,0:48:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,费尔奇先生.请招集幽灵
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫它们搜查城堡里每一幅画.找到胖夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.01,0:48:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要叫幽灵了.教授
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.88,0:49:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖夫人在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.85,0:49:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，嘿，走路小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.90,0:49:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点.我是男生会主席
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.29,0:49:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都快回来 - 回来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.29,0:49:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿.这是谁干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.10,0:49:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一双魔鬼的眼睛 灵魂就像他名字那样黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.07,0:49:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他.校长 大伙说的那个人.他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.24,0:49:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.91,0:49:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.31,0:49:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜查城堡.费尔奇先生.其他人都去礼堂。好了.都接着走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.48,0:50:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搜寻了天文塔、猫头鹰栖息地 那儿什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.58,0:50:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 三楼也没有情况
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.18,0:50:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常好 - 我去地窖里查过了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.45,0:50:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没发现布莱克 其他地方也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.36,0:50:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他不会逗留不走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.09,0:50:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真够本事的.你说他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,单枪匹马进入霍格沃茨城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.10,0:50:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神不知鬼不觉的 - 的确
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.97,0:50:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么进来的.你想过？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.00,0:50:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,想过不少.可没有一个是可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.21,0:50:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,您也许还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.91,0:50:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,新学期开始前.你任命卢平教授时
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.91,0:50:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经表示过担忧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,城堡里没有一个教师会帮助小天狼星布莱克潜入
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.42,0:50:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信城堡是安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.99,0:50:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是希望能把学生们送回他们各自的学院
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.79,0:50:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么波特呢.该警告他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.33,0:50:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧.可现在让他睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.83,0:51:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡梦中我们会进入完全属于自己的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.87,0:51:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他在最深的海洋中畅游 或者在最高的云彩上滑翔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.68,0:51:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把书翻到第394页
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.46,0:52:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起.老师 卢平教授在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.73,0:52:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不该你操心.对吗.波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.37,0:52:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,原因很简单.你们的教授 目前身体欠佳.无法前来授课
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.44,0:52:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把书翻到第394页
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.28,0:52:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是狼人？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.28,0:52:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是老师… 我们刚学红帽子和哼皮蓬
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.29,0:52:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几星期后才学夜间的野兽 - 安静
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.62,0:52:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她几时进来的？ 你看见她进来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.43,0:52:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在.你们当中有谁能告诉我 阿尼玛格斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.13,0:52:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,和狼人的区别
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.30,0:52:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.74,0:52:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真令人失望 - 我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.84,0:52:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尼玛格斯可以选择变成动物
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.14,0:52:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而狼人却没有选择
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.11,0:52:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当月圆之夜他变形时
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.01,0:52:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就忘了自己是谁 连最好的朋友他也会杀
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.08,0:53:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外… 狼人只回应他的同类发出的喊声
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.82,0:53:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢.马尔福先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.76,0:53:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第二次抢着发言了.格兰杰小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.26,0:53:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是缺乏自制呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.43,0:53:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是乐于做一个… 让人厌恶的万事通
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.10,0:53:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说得挺有道理 - 格兰芬多扣五分
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.70,0:53:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了惩罚你们的无知 星期一早上每人交一篇文章
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.51,0:53:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,两卷羊皮纸.内容是狼人 在文章中重点阐述
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.34,0:53:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如何识别狼人 - 老师.明天有魁地奇
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.05,0:53:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我建议你得格外保重 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.59,0:53:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺胳膊断腿照样得写文章
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.82,0:53:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把书翻到第394页
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.60,0:53:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人叫Werewolf
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.00,0:53:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它由安德鲁斯·萨克逊语中的两个单词 WERE 和 WOLF 组成
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.50,0:53:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,前者的意思是“男人”后者的意思是“狼”
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.70,0:53:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人 有好几种方法可以变成
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.84,0:54:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人被赐予
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.90,0:54:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,变形的本领、被一个狼人咬
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.87,0:54:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油.哈利… - 加油.哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.26,0:56:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩斯达麦特
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.33,0:56:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他脸色惨白.是吗？ - 惨白？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.67,0:56:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还能怎样.一百英尺高空摔下来 - 行了.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从天文塔上摔下来.你会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.21,0:56:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会比他平时要好看
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.88,0:56:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉怎么样？ - 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.05,0:56:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们吓坏了.伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.28,0:56:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样了？ - 你摔下了扫帚
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.05,0:56:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我们比赛.谁赢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.83,0:57:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人怪你.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.80,0:57:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄魂怪不应该进入学校的 邓布利多大发雷霆
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.80,0:57:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一救下了你就赶走了它们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.07,0:57:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外.还有一件事你应该知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.31,0:57:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摔下来时.你的扫帚…被风吹到打人柳那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.60,0:57:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果…它就
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.85,0:57:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的扫帚坏了.真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.45,0:57:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没办法修好它？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.29,0:57:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.82,0:57:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 摄魂怪对我的影响怎么这么大？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.56,0:57:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要比…对别人大许多 - 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.83,0:57:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄魂怪是最邪恶生物之一 他们吸食每一种
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.20,0:57:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,美好的情感 每一段快乐的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.04,0:57:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到把人美好的东西都吸光 只剩下最糟的往事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.81,0:57:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…并不是软弱.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.18,0:58:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄魂怪对你影响最大 是因为你曾经历过真正的恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.45,0:58:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那些同学几乎无法想象
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.02,0:58:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要觉得羞耻
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.52,0:58:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我害怕.教授 - 你要是不害怕那倒是傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.73,0:58:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要学会跟它们斗 你可以教我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.40,0:58:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车上那个就是你赶走的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.60,0:58:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.67,0:58:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你赶走了它 - 我可不是在假扮专家.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.58,0:58:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可照目前的情况来看 摄魂怪对你特别感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.71,0:58:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我应该教你 不过得过了假期
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在.我需要休息
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.01,0:59:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备去霍格莫德 快.同学们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.80,0:59:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以… - 求你放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.80,0:59:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是他不够聪明 - 再说我们有更好的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.07,0:59:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求求你们了.我想去霍格莫德 - 我们知道
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.07,0:59:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别担心 - 我们会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.61,0:59:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知一条捷径 - 只要你安静
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.31,0:59:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我.求你们啦 - 好了.伙计们.不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.51,0:59:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在.哈利。跟大哥们一块玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.52,0:59:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.92,0:59:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么垃圾？ - 他管这叫垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可是我们成功的秘密 - 还舍不得给你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.43,0:59:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们认为 你比我们更需要
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.50,0:59:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治.开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.47,0:59:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我郑重宣誓.我会用这来搞怪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.37,1:00:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,月亮脸、虫尾巴、大脚板、尖头叉子…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.34,1:00:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,自豪地献上活点地图
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.55,1:00:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真得感谢他们
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.35,1:00:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等.这是霍格沃茨 那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.36,1:00:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦.不 - 那这个是…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.26,1:00:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在他书房 - 踱步…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.43,1:00:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老踱步
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.70,1:00:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这地图能看到… - 每个人…每个人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.70,1:00:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个人？在哪？ - 在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.90,1:00:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每分钟… - 每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了.哪来的？ - 从费尔奇办公室偷来的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.37,1:00:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一年级时 - 好了.听着.有七条密道能走出城堡
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.34,1:00:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们推荐这一条…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.08,1:00:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 独眼女巫通道 - 直接通往蜜蜂公爵地窖
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.41,1:00:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过得快.费尔奇正过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.42,1:00:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔.哈利.别忘了 完事后.只要敲它一下.并说
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.02,1:00:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,“恶作剧完毕” 不然谁都能看它
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.15,1:01:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.11,1:01:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,全英国闹鬼最厉害的鬼屋 这我提过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.35,1:01:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两遍了 - 呃
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.75,1:01:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想走得更近一些吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.29,1:01:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,离尖叫屋近些
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.29,1:02:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…其实我.我在这儿挺好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.33,1:02:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.瞧瞧.这是谁呀
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.59,1:02:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,想买套新的梦之屋？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.90,1:02:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太大了点吧.小蠢蛋 你家里人是睡一间房？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.60,1:02:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你闭嘴.马尔福 - 喔.不太友好嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.11,1:02:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们.该教教韦斯莱小蠢蛋 怎么尊重长辈的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.38,1:02:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长辈不会是你吧 - 敢这么跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.98,1:02:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这肮脏的小泥巴种
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.19,1:02:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.99,1:02:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别傻站着.帮我 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.15,1:03:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么的了.马尔福？滑雪板丢了？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.39,1:03:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闪开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.29,1:03:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.06,1:03:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福！等我！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.87,1:03:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.97,1:03:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼啊.哈利 这可不好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.17,1:03:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个坏蛋 从没跟我提过活点地图
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.64,1:03:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利不会留着的 他会把地图交给麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.28,1:03:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吗？ - 喔.当然.连同他的隐形斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.42,1:03:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔.快瞧那个人.是罗丝莫塔女士
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.16,1:03:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩迷恋她 - 别胡说
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.59,1:03:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦格教授 - 康奈利
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.66,1:03:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我来.部长
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.23,1:03:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦.海格！ - 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.30,1:03:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝莫塔.亲爱的.希望你生意兴隆
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你的魔法部不让摄魂怪 每隔一天晚上来搜查.那…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.47,1:03:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的生意会比现在好多了 - 我们…有个杀人凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.91,1:04:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在逃 - 小天狼星布莱克来霍格莫德
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.44,1:04:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他为什么来？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为哈利波特 - 哈利波特？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.72,1:04:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.47,1:04:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿.未成年男巫今天不能入内 - 把该死的门关上
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.14,1:04:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真没礼貌 - 呆头呆脑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.37,1:04:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呆头呆脑？ - 好大胆！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.14,1:04:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说谁呆头呆脑 - 有逆反的小崽仔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.08,1:04:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人们发现店里有摄魂怪 以后谁还敢来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.15,1:04:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多不希望摄魂怪来干扰。这我可保证
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.86,1:04:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说.这到底怎么回事儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.82,1:04:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧.许多年前.当哈利波特的父母 发现自己被追杀时
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.50,1:04:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就藏了起来 没多少人知道他们藏哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.37,1:04:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过布莱克知道 他告诉了神秘人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.40,1:05:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上布莱克不光 带神秘人去了波特家
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.81,1:05:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还杀他们的一个朋友小矮星彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.38,1:05:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小矮星彼得？ - 对.就是那个矮胖男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.75,1:05:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总跟在布莱克的身后 - 噢.想起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.15,1:05:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟詹姆斯和布莱克形影不离
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.15,1:05:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 后来呢？ - 彼得想去警告波特的父母
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.05,1:05:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来可以成功的.可不料撞见了个老朋友 就是布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.46,1:05:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克凶狠毒辣 他不光杀死彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.49,1:05:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且毁灭了他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.30,1:05:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一根手指.彼得只剩一根手指 没别的了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.24,1:05:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀.虽然不是布莱克亲手杀的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.23,1:05:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可正因为他.他们才会死 - 现在他想斩草除根
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.84,1:05:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这我不相信 - 这还不是最糟的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.88,1:05:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢.还有更更糟的？ - 听着.布莱克以前是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.85,1:05:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且现在依然是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.42,1:05:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利波特的教父
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.70,1:05:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩.快瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.74,1:06:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起.对不起.让一下.请让一下 - 圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.74,1:06:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.08,1:06:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是他们的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.72,1:06:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他出卖了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.75,1:06:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,算什么朋友！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.96,1:07:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他找到我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.56,1:07:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到我.我跟他拼了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.40,1:07:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到我.我就杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.25,1:07:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.38,1:07:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊.你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.42,1:07:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要学吗.哈利？ 这是一种非常高深的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.46,1:07:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大大高出普通魔法师的水平
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.09,1:07:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要学
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.19,1:07:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了.一切就绪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.93,1:07:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会儿要教你念的咒语 叫守护神符咒
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.50,1:07:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.00,1:07:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护神是一种正面力量 魔法师若能使用它
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.74,1:07:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就像一块盾牌.使摄魂怪改变目标。以它为食粮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.55,1:07:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为使它起作用 必须回忆一段往事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.55,1:08:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且得是快乐的往事 一段强有力的回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.72,1:08:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能行吗？ 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.73,1:08:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.73,1:08:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中思想
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.90,1:08:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,探索你的过去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.50,1:08:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有回忆了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.97,1:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它笼罩着你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,让自己沉浸其中
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.24,1:08:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后说出这条咒语 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.02,1:08:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.66,1:08:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吗？ 魔杖准备
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.81,1:09:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊克斯派克托…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.78,1:09:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊克斯派克托…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.52,1:09:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了.来吧.坐起来 深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.89,1:09:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我没指望你第一次就能成功
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.10,1:09:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然也太神了 来.吃这个.会好些的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好可怕的摄魂怪 - 嗬.不不不….
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.17,1:09:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个博格特.博格特
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.08,1:09:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的.更可怕 比这可怕得多
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.41,1:09:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我很想知道.你在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.21,1:09:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 选了哪一段回忆？ - 第一次骑扫帚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.12,1:09:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不够好.实在不够好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.33,1:09:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一段 它不算…快乐…可又
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.57,1:10:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快乐…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.84,1:10:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最快乐的记忆
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.58,1:10:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可又是那么复杂 - 够强烈吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.92,1:10:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就试试吧 准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.56,1:10:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.37,1:10:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.40,1:11:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.50,1:11:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好.哈利.干得好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.44,1:11:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想今天我练够了 - 是啊.坐下.来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.71,1:11:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃这个.挺管用的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.31,1:11:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你吧.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.25,1:11:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的表现已经跟你老爸 不相上下了，这已经…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.42,1:11:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很了不起了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.65,1:11:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想的是他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.82,1:11:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,和妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.16,1:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见他们的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.03,1:11:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.90,1:11:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.37,1:11:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选了那段回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.30,1:11:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是真是假
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.24,1:11:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是最美的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.65,1:11:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天气真好 - 好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.15,1:11:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你被撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.29,1:12:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,撕成碎片.你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.89,1:12:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩把他的耗子给丢了 - 我可没把它丢了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.23,1:12:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 被你的猫吃了 - 净胡扯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.56,1:12:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.你也见过 她那只凶残的坏猫总是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.07,1:12:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,贼头贼脑的 我的斑斑没了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.14,1:12:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该学会怎么照顾好你的宠物
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.18,1:12:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的猫把它吃了 - 没吃
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.41,1:12:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃了 - 没吃
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.95,1:12:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听证会开得怎么样.海格？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.75,1:12:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯.首先.委员们轮流谈了一下
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.22,1:12:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要召开听证会
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.76,1:12:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我做了陈述.我说巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.59,1:12:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是头好动物 总是清洁它的羽毛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.80,1:12:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后.卢修斯·马尔福发言 结果可想而知
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.00,1:12:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说巴克比克是致命的生物
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.37,1:12:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是危险的.它会杀人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.61,1:12:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.11,1:12:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢修斯要求最严厉的惩罚
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.98,1:13:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们不能开除你 - 不.我没被开除
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.22,1:13:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克比克被判处了死刑
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.08,1:13:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有蜘蛛…有…有蜘蛛 蜘蛛要和我跳踢踏舞
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.82,1:13:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想跳踢踏舞 - 那你跟蜘蛛说呀
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.56,1:13:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀.跟它们说 会说的.明天再说
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.60,1:13:52.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（费尔奇）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.44,1:13:56.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小矮星彼得）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.68,1:14:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小矮星彼得？ - 就是那个矮胖男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.02,1:14:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总跟在布莱克的身后 - 布莱克凶狠毒辣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.35,1:14:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不光杀死了彼得 而且毁灭了他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.90,1:14:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快把灯熄了 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.58,1:14:35.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（哈利波特 小矮星彼得）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.93,1:14:50.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小矮星彼得）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.27,1:15:04.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小矮星彼得）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.61,1:15:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心点.孩子 - 别吵着我们睡觉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.78,1:15:16.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯内普）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.96,1:15:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶作剧完毕.莫克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.76,1:15:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.26,1:15:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上你在走廊里转悠些什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.97,1:15:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在梦游呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.20,1:15:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你的父亲怎么就这么像呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.00,1:15:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特他也是这么目中无人.趾高气扬 在城堡里逛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.94,1:15:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸没有趾高气扬 我也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.01,1:15:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不介意 麻烦你把手中的魔杖放下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.65,1:15:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.16,1:15:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把东西…拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.69,1:15:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.50,1:16:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 空白羊皮纸 - 打开.打开
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.37,1:16:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现出你的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.81,1:16:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来念
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.72,1:16:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,月亮脸.虫尾巴.大脚板 尖头叉子四位先生
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.42,1:16:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,向斯内普先生问候致意 同时…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.83,1:16:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,念下去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.50,1:16:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时请求他不要伸长他的大鼻子 管别人的闲事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.60,1:16:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃.好你个胆大包天的小子 - 教授先生
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.77,1:16:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…喔.卢平
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.64,1:16:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来散步吗？月光下漫步.是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.71,1:16:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.35,1:16:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就得看情况啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.65,1:17:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从波特这儿没收了一个 相当奇怪的小玩意
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.56,1:17:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看吧.卢平 这应该是你的专长
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.26,1:17:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很显然这上面满是黑魔法… - 嗬.我看这也未必.西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.23,1:17:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是张特制的羊皮纸 谁要读它的内容
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.80,1:17:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就羞辱谁 我猜这是佐科的产品.然而
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.97,1:17:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该查一下 它是否还暗藏什么特性
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.38,1:17:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你说的.这是我的专长 哈利.请跟我过来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.68,1:17:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？教授.晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.02,1:17:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你聋了吗？快把灯熄啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.87,1:17:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.10,1:17:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是一点都不明白.哈利 这地图怎么会落在你的手里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.51,1:17:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可坦白地说 我十分的震惊.你居然没有上交
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.15,1:17:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过没有这要是落到布莱克的手里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.81,1:18:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就能通过地图找到你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.82,1:18:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.29,1:18:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲也是个不爱遵守规定的人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.53,1:18:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他和你母亲为了救你 献出了他们的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.74,1:18:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,却毫无戒备地在城堡里闲逛这么做算报答他们吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.41,1:18:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不会再为你掩饰了.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.74,1:18:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听见了吗？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.35,1:18:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你立刻回宿舍.呆在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.18,1:18:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别又绕远了 你要绕.我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.63,1:18:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授.其实这地图 并不是每次都准的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.93,1:18:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才它显示有个人在城堡 可那人已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.30,1:18:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.21,1:18:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小矮星彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.38,1:19:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.68,1:19:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我看见了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.18,1:19:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安.教授
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.39,1:19:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开阔你们的思路 眼光必须放远
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,水晶球占卜术的技巧在于 使你的天目变得清晰
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.33,1:19:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样.你们才能看见.再试一试
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.20,1:19:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了.这儿有什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.64,1:19:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃.我能试试吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.25,1:19:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…不详.有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.00,1:19:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 从你踏进我课堂的那一刻起
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.30,1:19:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就感觉你并不具备…卓越的法术
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.63,1:19:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,占卜所要求的素质 你瞧这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.70,1:19:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔.你虽然年纪小小 可惜你枯萎，就像一个老姑娘
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.43,1:20:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你灵魂就像这些书的纸张那么干
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.70,1:20:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些你勤奋苦读的书
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.36,1:20:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.03,1:20:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的失去理智了 赫敏她以前时常也会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.20,1:20:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在居然是在大庭广众之下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.97,1:20:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.34,1:20:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这得还回去 - 我才去咧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.54,1:20:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那好.回头见 - 回头见
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.72,1:21:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.86,1:21:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特里劳妮教授 - 今晚他会回来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.30,1:21:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.14,1:21:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克.今晚.那出卖他朋友的人 那沦为杀人犯的人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.94,1:21:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,将挣脱锁链
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.14,1:21:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜者的鲜血将流淌
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.55,1:21:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那仆人和他的主子将再一次联起手来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.89,1:22:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉.孩子 你说什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.96,1:22:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.20,1:22:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.35,1:23:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们居然要杀巴克比克 太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在更糟了 - 告诉你们.我爸爸说我能留着
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.46,1:23:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪兽的头.我想我会把它 捐给格兰芬多公共休息室
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.83,1:23:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.一定带劲
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.47,1:23:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧.谁来了 - 哇.来看好戏的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.83,1:23:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你这个恶心、讨厌、恶毒的小蟑螂
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.10,1:23:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏.别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.44,1:23:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做不值得
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.79,1:23:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福.你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.06,1:23:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了.我们走…等等我 - 不许跟人何人说.懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.43,1:23:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉真好 - 不光是好.是爽歪了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.29,1:24:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔.你瞧它 它爱风吹过石树的气息
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.76,1:24:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干脆放了它？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.19,1:24:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,会怀疑是我放的 会给邓布利多找麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.80,1:24:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一会儿也要来他说要陪我度过…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.00,1:24:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一会儿也要来他说要陪我度过…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.37,1:24:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,度过这一刻
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.57,1:24:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好人啦.邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.91,1:24:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个大好人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.91,1:24:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们也陪你.海格 - 你们可别这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.05,1:24:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幕惨戮不会让你们看到的 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.42,1:24:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝完茶就走吧 呃.临走之前.罗恩…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.50,1:24:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,斑斑.你还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.03,1:24:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得看好宠物.罗恩 - 看来现在你该道歉了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.94,1:25:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃对.下次我见到克鲁克山 会赔不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.87,1:25:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是向我道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.64,1:25:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要命.怎么回事儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.32,1:25:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.65,1:25:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.46,1:25:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不.部长.就在这里边 还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.39,1:25:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不早了.天快黑了 你们该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.66,1:25:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上在城堡外面被人看见 就麻烦了.那是大麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.60,1:25:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你.哈利 马上就来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.61,1:25:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.21,1:25:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.11,1:25:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的.都会好的 - 快走.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.88,1:25:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那叫石楠.石楠看见了吗？ - 就在那小山
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.85,1:25:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坡上。- 海格.你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.69,1:25:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邓布利多教授 - 部长
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.59,1:25:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 部长.快进屋吧.我们喝杯茶 - 不用.海格
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.53,1:26:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生们 - 我想喝杯茶
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.30,1:26:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好.我们言归正传了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.80,1:26:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,处置危险生物委员会 现在作出决定.鹰头马兽
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.57,1:26:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒守法令.要成为死囚犯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.91,1:26:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,将于今天日落时被处决
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.58,1:26:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪… - 好了.好了.海格.好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.32,1:26:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧.不会有事的 - 行刑手将死囚犯进行斩首处决
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.89,1:26:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.79,1:26:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像看见…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.06,1:26:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 算了.没什么 - 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.30,1:26:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克比克可没有造成伤人啦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.12,1:27:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦.不
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.50,1:27:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他咬我.斑斑！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.30,1:27:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.20,1:27:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩 - 斑斑.回来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.24,1:27:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.92,1:28:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斑斑.你咬我 - 哈利.你应该认识这棵树吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.39,1:28:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不妙.罗恩快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.83,1:28:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.赫敏.快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.93,1:28:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不详
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.60,1:28:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 罗恩…罗恩…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.84,1:28:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.41,1:28:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救我！- 罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.92,1:28:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩.罗恩 - 罗恩！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.03,1:28:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.97,1:28:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.41,1:29:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.01,1:29:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.23,1:29:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真对不起 - 没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.40,1:30:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说这通往那儿？ - 我已经猜到了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.03,1:30:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在尖叫屋.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.30,1:30:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.28,1:30:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.21,1:30:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩.没事就好 - 那狗.它在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.05,1:30:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.他就是那狗.他是阿尼玛格斯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,想杀哈利.就把我们也杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.10,1:31:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不.今晚只会死一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.10,1:31:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.25,1:31:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是要杀我吗.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.62,1:31:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊克斯派里阿默斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.19,1:31:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.好哇.布莱克 你都成这幅邋遢样了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.56,1:31:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这外表终于配上你内心的疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.20,1:31:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的内心也同样疯狂 不是吗？雷莫斯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.24,1:31:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找到他了 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.21,1:31:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在这儿 - 这我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.91,1:31:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了他 - 不.我那么信任你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.55,1:31:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来…你一直是布莱克的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.99,1:32:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个狼人.所以他没法来上课
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.86,1:32:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道多久了？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.06,1:32:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 自从写了斯内普布置的文章 - 好吧 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.47,1:32:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这年纪的魔法师数你最聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.60,1:32:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了.雷莫斯.快点去杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.20,1:32:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 我已经等够了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.97,1:32:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等了十二年了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.01,1:32:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在阿兹卡班…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.89,1:32:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧…杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.19,1:32:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你还得再等上一分钟 他有权知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.13,1:32:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.93,1:32:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出卖了我的父母
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.33,1:32:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你把他们害死的 - 不.哈利.不是他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.44,1:32:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确有人出卖你的父母 不过是别人
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.50,1:32:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我最近才知道… 那个人其实并没有死
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.21,1:32:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那人是谁？ - 彼得.小矮星
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.85,1:32:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在屋里.就现在
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.48,1:33:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来…出来.彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.62,1:33:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧.快出来玩 - 伊克斯派里阿默斯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.56,1:33:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.复仇可真有快感
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.00,1:33:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如愿以偿.亲手抓住你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.66,1:33:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.20,1:33:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟邓布利多说你在帮老朋友进入城堡.现在这就是证据
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.10,1:33:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了.斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.60,1:33:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次.你那敏锐的洞察力又失误了 又得出了错误的结论
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.18,1:33:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不奉陪了 雷莫斯.我还有未了的事情要解决
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.01,1:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我个理由 - 让我杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.18,1:33:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西弗拉斯.你别傻 - 他是傻瓜.改不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.99,1:33:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布莱克.你安静！ - 给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.72,1:33:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧.听听你们俩.像老两口在拌嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.32,1:33:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你还是去玩过家家.配你的魔药吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.39,1:33:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全能杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.36,1:33:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可还是请摄魂怪代劳吧 他们一直盼着…见你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.20,1:33:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像有点害怕了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.07,1:33:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔.摄魂怪的吻.想想吧 那滋味一定够受的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.71,1:34:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说那场面实在是惨不忍睹 可我还是想…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.35,1:34:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗拉斯.别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.62,1:34:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.06,1:34:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊克斯派里阿默斯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.56,1:34:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利.你干了什么？ - 你攻击了老师！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.37,1:34:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我彼得的事 - 以前他跟我们是同学
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.10,1:34:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当他是朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.97,1:34:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不.彼得死了 是你杀的 - 不.不是他
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.11,1:34:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也以为是他 直到你说起在地图上看见了彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.54,1:34:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那地图撒谎 - 那地图从不撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.51,1:34:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得还活着.他就在那儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.95,1:34:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？这人疯了… - 不是你.是你的耗子！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.82,1:34:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斑斑已经在我家呆了… - 十二年！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.13,1:34:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只普通耗子能活那么长吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.79,1:34:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他缺一个指头.对吗？ - 那又怎么！！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.56,1:34:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当时只找到彼得的… - 手指！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.73,1:35:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那懦夫把它割了 让大家以为他死了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.17,1:35:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后他变形.变成了耗子 - 证明！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.78,1:35:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快给他.罗恩 - 你要把他怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.05,1:35:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,斑斑.把他放了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.28,1:35:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许碰他 你要干嘛！斑斑
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.84,1:35:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷莫斯
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.44,1:35:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…这是布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.11,1:35:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老朋友们
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.65,1:35:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利…瞧瞧你 你跟你父亲可真像.真像…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.66,1:35:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯.我们曾经是最好的朋友 - 你居然敢跟哈利说话
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.16,1:35:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然敢在他面前提起詹姆斯
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.00,1:36:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把詹姆斯和莉莉出卖给了伏地魔.对吗 - 其实我也不想
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.40,1:36:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那黑魔头.天知道他有什么武器
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.40,1:36:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问你自己吧.你会怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.41,1:36:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会怎么做 - 我宁愿死！我宁愿死也不会出卖我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.18,1:36:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.詹姆斯不会让我死，你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.75,1:36:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会饶了我 他会饶了我的命
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.92,1:36:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早该明白.彼得.伏地魔没杀你我们也会杀你.一齐动手
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.33,1:36:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.87,1:36:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利.这个人他是… - 我知道他是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.00,1:36:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带到城堡去
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.10,1:36:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保佑你.孩子.保佑你 - 滚开
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.28,1:36:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把你带到城堡
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.05,1:36:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后.让摄魂怪处置你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.19,1:37:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉.咬了你 一定有点疼吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.09,1:37:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点？一点？ 你差点咬断我的腿
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.79,1:37:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想抓那耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.53,1:37:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我变成狗的时候脾气挺温顺的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.53,1:37:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实.不只一次詹姆斯建议我 永远变成温顺的狗
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.97,1:37:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗尾巴我能忍受 可跳蚤.真要命
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.39,1:37:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.90,1:37:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去吧 - 别担心.没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.60,1:37:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.80,1:37:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下.去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.10,1:37:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吗？ - 没事.走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.77,1:37:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来一定很疼 - 疼得要命
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.94,1:37:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许…也许会锯掉
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.98,1:38:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞弗雷夫人一下子就能治好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.82,1:38:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了.治不好了.一定会被锯掉
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.29,1:38:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧那儿多美呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.96,1:38:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远忘不了第一次 踏进城堡的大门
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.43,1:38:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为自由人.再次走进去 感觉一定好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.73,1:38:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定不杀他很宽宏大量
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.37,1:38:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他真的不配
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.67,1:38:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸不会希望他的好朋友 变成杀人犯的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.01,1:38:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸不会希望他的好朋友 变成杀人犯的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.75,1:38:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说.真相要是活着
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.62,1:38:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能自由
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.15,1:38:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你了.把我变成虫子也行.就是别交给摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.46,1:38:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩.我是好朋友吧.是好宠物吧 别把我交给摄魂怪.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.96,1:38:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.63,1:38:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好姑娘.聪明姑娘.你不会让他们… - 别缠着他们.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.13,1:38:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是知道.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.20,1:38:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出生的时候 你父母让我做你的教父
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.47,1:39:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.58,1:39:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你还想住姨父家 我也能理解
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.81,1:39:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你要是想要个不同的家…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.48,1:39:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？跟你一起住？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.29,1:39:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃.这…这是个想法 你要不愿意.我也理解
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.56,1:39:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.61,1:39:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷莫斯.我的好朋友 你今晚服过药吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.61,1:39:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个真正的人.雷莫斯 这颗心是你真正的生命.这颗心.这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.32,1:39:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是有血有肉的人
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.46,1:39:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊克斯派里阿默斯
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.64,1:40:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.30,1:40:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷莫斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.45,1:40:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑.快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.79,1:40:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.00,1:40:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫敏 - 别过去…别过去…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.30,1:40:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢平教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.61,1:40:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢平教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.92,1:40:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好狗狗.好狗狗
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.59,1:40:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿.波特
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.92,1:41:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.79,1:41:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来.波特
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.03,1:42:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.23,1:42:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不.布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.07,1:43:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.74,1:45:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.05,1:45:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.61,1:45:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.38,1:45:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他赶走了摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.08,1:45:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在湖对面
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.69,1:45:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着.哈利.他们抓走了布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.55,1:45:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄魂怪随时会给他一个吻
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.56,1:45:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要处死他？ - 不.更糟
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.26,1:46:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,比死还糟
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.26,1:46:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吸出他的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.33,1:46:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,校长.你必须阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.90,1:46:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们抓错人了 - 是的.校长.布莱克是清白的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.47,1:46:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是斑斑干的 - 斑斑？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.81,1:46:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.61,1:46:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是真的耗子 他以前是耗子.我哥哥珀西的耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.61,1:46:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可后来他就有了猫头鹰… - 我们知道了真相
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.48,1:46:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请相信我们 - 我相信.格兰杰小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.22,1:46:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可三个十三岁小魔法师说的话 其他人很难相信
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.73,1:46:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论说得多诚实.如果别人不愿听
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.66,1:46:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再怎么说.也都是毫无意义的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.64,1:46:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是多么神秘
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.34,1:46:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么有力
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.85,1:46:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间被搅乱.就有危险
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.32,1:46:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克被关在黑塔最高的牢房里
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.75,1:47:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道规定.赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.02,1:47:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让人看见
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.99,1:47:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看最好在钟敲最后一声之前赶回来
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.83,1:47:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话.这后果将不堪设想
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.90,1:47:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果今晚成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.90,1:47:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能拯救不只一条无辜的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.54,1:47:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,转三下就可以
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.65,1:47:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔.我随便说一句
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.65,1:47:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要记住.拿不定主意时 照原路再走一次是明智之举
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.65,1:47:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.22,1:47:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼.这是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.36,1:47:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起.罗恩.你好好养伤吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.69,1:48:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.46,1:48:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩呢？ - 七点半
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.93,1:48:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,七点半时.我们在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.96,1:48:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在去海格的小屋吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.93,1:48:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走.不能被看见
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.40,1:48:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.42,1:48:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏…赫敏.等等
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.89,1:48:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏.拜托.告诉我这是在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.66,1:48:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个恶心、讨厌、恶毒的小蟑螂
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.70,1:48:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们耶
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.27,1:48:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏.别这样 这么做不值得
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.37,1:48:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.11,1:49:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是时间转换器.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.65,1:49:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一学期.麦格教授给我的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.01,1:49:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以一学年来.我能同时上几门课
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.58,1:49:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们回到了以前 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.95,1:49:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然邓布利多就是要我们回到这一刻
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.63,1:49:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是要我们改变已经发生的事
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.93,1:49:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一拳很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.43,1:49:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.97,1:49:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马尔福来了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.51,1:49:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不许跟人何人说.懂吗？ - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.31,1:49:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会收拾那狂妄的泥巴种.等着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.55,1:49:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉真好 - 不光是好.是爽歪了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.40,1:49:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧.海格的小屋
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.57,1:50:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快瞧.巴克比克还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.58,1:50:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.65,1:50:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得邓布利多怎么说的？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.81,1:50:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果成功了 能拯救不只一条无辜的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.22,1:50:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.84,1:50:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 得赶快去
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.11,1:50:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让福吉看到巴克比克.我们再偷
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.78,1:50:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他会怀疑是海格
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.28,1:50:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斑斑.你还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.85,1:50:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得看好宠物… - 那是彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.86,1:50:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利.不能去 - 那家伙出卖了我父母.你要我
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.93,1:50:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这儿干坐着？ - 是的.必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.80,1:51:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.当时你在海格的小屋
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.70,1:51:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在闯进去 你会以为自己疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.70,1:51:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡乱改变过去.下场会很惨的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.74,1:51:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让人看见
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.28,1:51:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,福吉来了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.92,1:51:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时该走了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.15,1:51:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时为什么不走？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.67,1:51:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.24,1:51:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很疼
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.81,1:51:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.00,1:52:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从后门出来了.走
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.08,1:52:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头发从后面看真是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.96,1:52:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.16,1:52:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像看见…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.19,1:52:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 算了.没事儿 - 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.18,1:52:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好.走.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.72,1:53:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.88,1:53:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃.部长.我想我用不着签名了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.15,1:53:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.52,1:53:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了.巴克比克.快来我们快点走.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.76,1:53:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点.快拉.快点
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.86,1:53:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点.快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.50,1:53:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 名字签在横线上 - 我的名字很长
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.17,1:53:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点.巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.58,1:54:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点.巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.75,1:54:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来.很好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.68,1:54:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿.快点.巴克比克 - 这儿.部长.跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.39,1:54:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧那儿.看见吗？ - 哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.26,1:54:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧岩石后面 - 你这是要我看什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.79,1:54:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,利皮教授做校长那会儿 种了那株石楠
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.46,1:54:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦.是的…没错.没错 - 还有那些草莓
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.30,1:54:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点.巴克比克.快点 - 我没见到草莓
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.27,1:54:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在那儿 - 哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.64,1:54:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在那儿 - 瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.61,1:54:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的.先把正事干完吧 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.95,1:54:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.58,1:54:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才还看见它呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.42,1:54:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一会儿就不见了 - 实在是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.79,1:54:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克比克？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.32,1:54:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕.邓布利多 是有人把它放了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.59,1:54:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 海格？ - 我发誓.不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.13,1:54:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想部长并没说这事跟你有关
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.36,1:55:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你呢 你一直跟我们在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.60,1:55:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对啊 - 那好.那好
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.67,1:55:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,得搜查整个场地
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.34,1:55:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要的话搜一下天空吧.部长
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.54,1:55:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，我想品一杯好茶或者一大杯白兰地
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.15,1:55:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔.行刑手 这儿不再需要你服务了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.32,1:55:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.39,1:55:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我屋子里可没有小杯子，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.50,1:55:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 这边
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.78,1:55:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.98,1:55:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在呢？ - 救布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.92,1:55:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么救？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.73,1:56:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里劳克拉斯！ - 瞧.是卢平
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.57,1:56:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着是斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.74,1:56:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们等着
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.61,1:56:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们等着
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.98,1:56:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少有人乐在其中 - 是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.05,1:56:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫敏？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.99,1:57:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,先前…在湖边跟布莱克一起时
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.49,1:57:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是看到一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.79,1:57:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是那个人赶走了摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.40,1:57:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,用守护神符咒
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.90,1:57:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普、邓布利多说过
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.97,1:57:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他们的意思…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.60,1:57:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有真正强大的魔法师才能施那个咒
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.20,1:57:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.17,1:57:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个施魔咒的是我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.14,1:57:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可你爸爸已经… - 死了.我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.81,1:57:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我的确看见了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.29,1:57:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.59,1:57:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见布莱克跟我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.13,1:57:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是要我跟他一起住 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.23,1:57:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等放了他.我就不用再回德思礼家了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.64,1:57:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我和他
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.94,1:57:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以住在乡村
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.04,1:57:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以看辽阔的天空
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.84,1:57:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,被关了这么多年 他渴望自由
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.71,1:58:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.82,1:58:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.43,1:58:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.51,1:58:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？ - 救你的命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.09,1:58:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.32,1:58:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他冲我们来了 - 这我没料到.跑
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.50,2:00:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.40,2:00:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的卢平一晚上真够呛
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.78,2:00:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克.快走
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.97,2:00:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可真恐怖 - 别担心
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.17,2:00:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸会来的.他会施守护神咒
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.15,2:00:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就要来了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.19,2:00:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那儿.你会看见的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.62,2:00:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利.听我说.没人会来
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.29,2:01:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心.他会来的.一定会来
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.00,2:01:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布莱克 - 你快死了…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.50,2:01:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克也是
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.41,2:01:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.04,2:01:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.54,2:02:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没对.赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.28,2:02:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,先前看到的不是我爸爸.是我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.78,2:02:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在使守护神咒.这次我知道
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.72,2:02:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能行.是因为…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.25,2:02:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功过
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.12,2:02:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这说得通吗？ - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.76,2:02:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢飞
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.74,2:02:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,冻德巴道
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.37,2:03:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命之恩.永生难忘
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.34,2:03:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.84,2:03:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想跟你走 - 以后吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.95,2:03:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来这段时间我会漂泊不定
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.02,2:03:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.69,2:03:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你该留在这儿 - 可…你是清白的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.16,2:03:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点你知道…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.36,2:03:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道就足够啦
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.56,2:03:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有句话你得听腻味了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.13,2:03:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得可真像你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.37,2:03:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.34,2:04:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的… - 眼睛像我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.58,2:04:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这挺惨酷.我跟你父母相处了 那么久，你却没这个福
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.28,2:04:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你记住
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.89,2:04:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱我们的人永远不会离开我们
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.43,2:04:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远能找到的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.80,2:04:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.04,2:04:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这年龄的女魔法师里.你最聪明
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.37,2:05:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.30,2:05:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么？ - 他自由了.我们做到了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.17,2:05:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,做到什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.87,2:05:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.58,2:05:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么蹦那儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.08,2:05:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话的时候在这儿 可现在在那儿？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.09,2:05:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在说什么啊？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.89,2:05:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人怎么可能同时在两个地方呢
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.92,2:06:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.03,2:06:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你来了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.43,2:06:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样子还不算是最糟的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.87,2:06:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被开除了？ - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.17,2:06:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不.其实我…辞职
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.31,2:06:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,辞职？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.25,2:06:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说漏了嘴 无意中把我的情况抖了出去
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.72,2:07:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天这时候.猫头鹰们就要捎信来了 家长们不会想要…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.39,2:07:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样的人.教他们的孩子
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.99,2:07:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可邓布利多… - 邓布利多为我担的风险
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.06,2:07:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经够多了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.10,2:07:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说.像我这样的人…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.00,2:07:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了.反正我都已经习以为常了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.88,2:07:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛哭丧着脸.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.62,2:07:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是徒劳
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.99,2:07:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得逃走了 - 一切都是徒劳？我看是扭转
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.69,2:07:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,乾坤了.你帮忙揭露 了真相.拯救了一个
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.36,2:07:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,清白的人免遭厄运
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.23,2:07:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能说是徒劳呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.40,2:07:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得骄傲的是
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.74,2:07:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这学年你学会了很多
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.58,2:07:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我不再是你的老师了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.51,2:08:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我可以无所顾忌地把这还给你
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.65,2:08:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该说再见了.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.32,2:08:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定会后会有期
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.46,2:08:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.13,2:08:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶作剧完毕
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.56,2:08:17.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（活点地图）
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.09,2:08:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许乱摸 不乖些.我就拿楼上去
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.47,2:08:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.70,2:08:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是从哪弄来的？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.30,2:08:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能骑吗.哈利？ 等你骑过之后
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.84,2:08:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在说什么呀？ - 都安静
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.17,2:09:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给老大让路 我…我其实没想打开的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.64,2:09:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可它包得很不好 他们叫我打开的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.31,2:09:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别胡说
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.18,2:09:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是火努箭 - 最快的飞天扫帚
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.85,2:09:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我的？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.59,2:09:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁送的？ - 没人知道
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.29,2:09:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.03,2:09:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 骑上去让我们看看 - 这下我们一定能赢魁地奇杯
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.90,2:09:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能飞多快.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.05,2:09:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼓德尤莫斯
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.86,2:09:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我郑重宣誓.我会用这个来搞怪
